<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">Lamma</book>
  <para style="h">Rooma</para>
  <para style="toc1">Bulus Sẽkoo yɛnɛ shɔ ROOMAYI BI</para>
  <para style="toc2">Roomayi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ro</para>
  <para style="mt2">Bulus sẽkoo yɛnɛ shɔ</para>
  <para style="mt1">ROOMAYI BI</para>
  <para style="imt1">Yutasinɛ</para>
  <para style="ip">Bulus bee sẽkoom yɛnɛ shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ ai Roomayi aru u masibii au ruu anɛ i ɗɔbii a Rooma. U vigbete mayɛ nɛn kasinɛn shovi pɛ ai tete sekaa, kɛɗɔn ai naapɔ̃nɛni nɗau yɛ tipi Sipɛn kɛkn. Beerɛ aru u tasiyidɔɔ u vizɛnɛ ayuu Kirisayi sisɨn ãnɛ a vigbete i yɛ zɛyɛ ai ɔ̃nɛ Kirisa. Laabeenɛm tuu nyanwanɛ gbete a Bulus nwari shɔyɛ piti kpai.</para>
  <para style="ip">A knti gbete Bulus yisi shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi nyageenɛtɛ a Rooma a nɔgbete geli nɛn gaki Ɗa ai yuuyɛni, a sha yuu sẽkoourɛ: &lt;&lt; Ruu tɔ̃vɨn ɓeli nɔgbete Ɗalapa pɔ̃ shɔ shɔu ɔ̃ tɔ̃vɨn a ukɔni: atette sisɨn ãnɛkɔ au gaanɛ yɛnɛ u nyayisinɛ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="ip">Kɛɗɔn Bulus yɛ ɗekɨn ayuu sekoo shanɛni. Shɔ piti kpai, Yahudawayi a shɔ gbete i ɓa Yahudawayi ɓayɛ, tɔ̃ɔ̃tɔ i ɔ̃ tɔ̃vɨn a Ɗalapa ɗekɨn, i piti kpai i pɛli ruuvinitɛ. Shɔ ɔ̃ tɔ̃vɨn a Ɗalapa ɗekɨn a nyaba ãsisɨn ãnɛ Yesɔ Kirisi kabii. Au ɗekɨn Bulus tasi shɔ nɔgbete shɔ kpaa suru sɔɔ aka yuɓasinɛ a Kirisini au ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ nyaba sɔɔ gbete shɔ kpaa ɔ̃nɛ a Ɗalapani. Shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ u ɔ̃nɛbiinyatɔ̃nɛ ɗɔn a Ɗa ɗekɨn, Ɗa Suru yɛ rautɔ a ruuvini naa a vɔrɔni. Au gɨn-gɨn 5-8, Bulus nwalinya wɔɔyi sɔ̃n aru Ɗalapa nyaãsinɛ a Ɗa Suru kaka a shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ ɔ̃nɛ. Kɛɗɔn jashonɛ i ntabiitɔ ai hɨnɛni nɔgbete Yahudawayi a shɔgbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa i kpaa tɔnɛ a Ɗalapa vigbete ma a shɔ yuu piti kpaiyɛ. A yisi nya nɛ Yahudawayi Yesɔ bɛ̃ɛ̃nɛ pɛjo Ɗa vimanɛkɔ, au n ti shɔzɛ piti kpai a Ɗalapa tɔ̃vɨn shonɛ a Yesɔ kabii, ã sisɨn tɛttɔ nɛ Yahudawayi i yɛ bɛ̃ɛ Yesɔ ɓa kopileepiya ɓa. U nyayisinɛ piti kpai, Bulus bee vikɛ ayuu nɔgbete Kirisayi ɔ̃nɛ yɛ ɔ̃yɛ, badijo ayuu ɔrinɛ ɔkɛ ɓasiyuunɛ a zɔni. Bulus tuu yuu ruum naa shɔ shoshi Ɗalapa vishonɛ, shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ i vishonɛ a siteti a ɓɛɛ zɔwɔyini, a ruu hɨnɛ ayuu viyuuyɔrinɛ. Kunya sẽkoou au nyaruuba konɛ a Ɗalapa bɛlinɛ.</para>
  <para style="iot">Vi au Ɓuzɨn yɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">Yutasinɛ a yuruu (1.1-17)</para>
  <para style="io1">Viu shɔzɛyi kã a koo piti ayuu raanɛ (1.18-3.20)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɗalapa nyaba shɔ raanɛ (3.21-4.25)</para>
  <para style="io1">Suru sɔɔ a Kirisi (5.1-8.39)</para>
  <para style="io1">Israila i a Ɗalapa rumanɛ (9.1-11.36)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kirisa vishonɛ (12.1-15.13)</para>
  <para style="io1">U nyayisinɛ a Bulus shɔ nyageenɛ (15.14-16.27)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1" />Nkɔ Bituru n bee labeenɛrɛ. Yesɔ Kirisi jawɛrɛ u jashonɛ gbete Ɗalapa lɔɔyɛ a ɓau nya nɛ u nwari shɔ ruutɔ̃vɨng a koo piti kpai. <verse eid="ROM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2" />Ruutɔ̃vɨng gbete Ɗalapa masi tẽe-tẽe au jashonɛyi, nagbete shɔ bee a labeenɛ Ɗa nyaruubii Wɔsɔ-wɔsɔyi. <verse eid="ROM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3" />Ruutɔ̃vɨng nwanya aru ɓɛjaa, Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi: au ruubii, shɔ yeeu a Dauda laduru; <verse eid="ROM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4" />ama au ruu Suru Wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ naa Ɗalapa, Ɗalapa tasiu kakani ukɔ Ɗalapa jagbete yulapa a yuu saa yɛ. <verse eid="ROM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5" />Au kaa bikɔ Ɗalapa ang nyaba kɛkn nɛn ɔ̃ jashonɛ aru Kirisi, a ruu gbetekɔ n ɔ̃ shɔ-shɔ ɗekɨn tɛɛsinɛ a laduru piti kpai nɗayi ɔ̃ shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ a shɔ nya gɨnnɛ ni. <verse eid="ROM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6" />Vim ɓasɔɔ yuujo nankɔ ɔ shɔ ɔ̃nɛ Roomani piti kpai, shɔgbete a Ɗalapa ɓawɔɔ nya nɛ ɔ ɔ̃ shɔ Yesɔ Kirisi gɨnnɛ.<verse eid="ROM 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7" />Aru gbetekɔ n beerɔɔ kɛkn piti kpai, shɔ Roomayi gbete Ɗalapa ɔrɔyɛ a ɓawɔɔ nya nɛ ɔ ɔ̃ u ɓɛshɔzɛ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔyi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 1:7">Mɛnɛ Ɗalapa au Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi u ã wɔɔ sisɨn vitɔ̃vɨng pɛlinɛ a ɔ̃nɛ nyazɔni.<verse eid="ROM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gakinɛ Ɗa dɔ̃rinɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8" />N gaa pɛ a Ɗa dɔ̃rinɛ a Yesɔ Kirisi ni awɔ yuu piti kpai, aru gbete ko-piya u ɗɔgbete nta ɔ ruu sisɨn pɔ̃nɛ a tipim piti kpai. <verse eid="ROM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9" />Ɗa kɔ ɔ̃rɛ n shɔ shirinɛ aru vigbete n shayɛ pɛ tɛpɛ-tɛpɛ Ɗa gbete ang shoshiu vishonɛ a sisɨn gbete a nyaba ruutɔ̃vɨng nwanɛ a ruu ɓɛjaani. Ɗalapa zɛtɛttɔ nɛn kpaa sisɨntɛ awɔ yuuni lee-lee <verse eid="ROM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10" />aɗagbete n gaki Ɗayɛ, n gaki Ɗa au tete vitɔ̃vɨng pɛlinɛ u yasin nyaba n awɔ ɗɔɔbiitɔ dɔdɔrim. <verse eid="ROM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11" />Arumkɔ n kasauwɔɔ zɛnɛtɛ waanɛ, nɗa ɔ kpaa Suru gbete sɔ̃nyaɓayɛ u vɔɔ susãri u lakɔɔ bitɔ. <verse eid="ROM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12" />Vigbete n shami u kpaa naa pɔ̃sinɛ a nyazɔ a ɔkɔni, ɔ lakin bi sɔ̃njo nagbete n lakɔɔ ɓɛ yɛ awɔ tete sisɨn ãnɛni.<verse eid="ROM 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13" />Ɔ kpaa sisɨntɔ masayi, n maatɛ ang sisɨn lee-lee n tɔ n kasɔɔ zɛnɛ, ama viwɔɔ zãrin pɛlinɛtɔ. N kasi shɔwɔyi kpaanɛ awɔ teteni, naa n kpaa atete shɔ gbete ayi ɓa Yahudawa ɓayɛ. <verse eid="ROM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14" />N vishonɛ aɗɔn n geli shɔ ruutɔ̃vɨng piti kpai yunɛ shɔ Helenayi bi yɛnɛ shɔ gbeteyi ɓa Helenayi ɓayɛ a shɔgbete i zɛ vitettɔ a shɔgbete i ji zɛ viɓayɛni. <verse eid="ROM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15" />Aru gbetenkɔ n kasitɔ waanɛ n nwarɔɔ Ɗa nya ruubii sɔ̃njo, shɔgbete ɔ a tipi Rooma yɛ.<verse eid="ROM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɗanyaruubii Kaka Ɗɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16" />N ji nta yuusẽ ɓa aɗɔ shɔ Ɗanyaruubii nwarinɛni ɓa; pɛ Ɗalapa au raashɔ sisɨn ãnɛirɛ, gaanɛ a shɔ Yahudawayi bi yɛnɛ a shɔgbeteyi ɓa Yahudawaɓa. <verse eid="ROM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17" />Ji nagbete Ɗanyaruubii ɓeli shɔ nɔgbete a Ɗalapa pɔ̃ shɔ a nyaba tɔ̃vɨn nɛ shɔ sɔ ɗɔbii: nɔgbete iyɛ ɔ̃ awuni aitette sisɨn ãnɛ yunɛ au gaanɛ yɛnɛ au yisinɛ. Nagebete Ɗa labeenɛ shayɛ nɛ,&lt;&lt;Shɔgbete ai kɛ pɛli vigbete Ɗalapa kasiyɛ nɛ atette sisɨn ãnɛ iyɛ ɔ̃tɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɗalapa Sisɨn gɨnvɔ̃ a Shɔruuvini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18" />Ɗalapa tasiu sisɨn gɨnvɔ̃ a kolapa ayuu ruuvini a vikɔ̃linɛ gbete shɔ pɛliyɛ au zãri shɔ tɔ̃vɨn zɛnɛ yɛ. <verse eid="ROM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19" />Ɗalapa yeeruu ayi yuu, aruviya vigbete au tasi shɔ Ɗalapa ruu biiyɛ jo ayi nɔɔ deredere weze, Ɗalapa au yuu ma tasi tɛttɔ. <verse eid="ROM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20" />Yunɛ aɗagbete Ɗalapa shɛshi kotipi yɛ, u vipɛlinɛ gbete shɔ zɛ ɓa piti au kaka gbete sɔ̃nyaɓa au ɔ̃nɛ Ɗalapa ni, shɔ zɛtɛtɔ wasa-wasa; shɔ ntau sẽẽ tɛtɔ a tete vigbete Ɗalapa pɛliyɛni. Aru gbetekɔ shɔzɛ nyanwanɛ wɔɔɓa gbete pɔ̃urɛ i ɔ̃ atette ruuvini ni ɓaǃ <verse eid="ROM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21" />I zɛ Ɗalapa tɛttɔ, ama iji ãu bassinɛ ɓa ko nɛyi dɔ̃riu pɛ ɓa. I sisɨn vipɛlinɛ ɔ̃tɛ wati weze, i lerinɛ sisɨn rãn ɔ̃tɛ ɓiti-ɓiti gbete pɔ̃irɛ i zɛ ɓa yɛ. <verse eid="ROM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22" />I tɔnɛ i zɛ vitettɔ ama iji rãan weze; <verse eid="ROM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23" />Naa i bassi Ɗalapayɛ, i bassi sɔ̃n laasupaa gbete shɔzɛ kɔri yɛ naa shɔzɛ ko janɔɔ ko vivaa ko vigbete ayi gɔ̃ a buru a tipi yɛ. <verse eid="ROM 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24" />Arumkɔ Ɗalapa ã shɔwi nyaba nɛi pɛli vikɔ̃linɛ gbete ayi sisɨn kasiyɛ, ai pɛli kpanta viyusẽe a zɔni. <verse eid="ROM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25" />I kɔsi Ɗalapa ruu nizɛ a nya nyazɔ̃; i bassi vigbete Ɗalapa kɔriyɛ i ya Ɗalapa biba sɔ̃n tipi, shɔgbete shɔ bɛliuyɛ dangdang! Nankɔ. <verse eid="ROM 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26" />Aru gbete i pɛli vim, Ɗalapa ãi kɛ sisɨn kɔ̃linɛ. Ko soro kɛ jo nɔɔ sɔrɔ vigbete Ɗalapa zãri shɔ pɛlinɛ yɛ. <verse eid="ROM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27" />Ji nankɔ a vɔshɔyini i yaa roonɛtɛ a soroni gbete Ɗalapa pɔ̃yɛ, i ɓasi kɛ ji ainɔɔ vɔshɔ. Vɔshɔyi pɛli viyusɛ̃ɛ̃tɛ a zɔɔni, aru nankɔ i n ti ruuyeenɛtɛ ai yuu aru vikɔ̃linɛ gbete i pɛliyɛni. <verse eid="ROM 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28" />Aru gbete shɔwi bẽẽ vitɔ̃vɨng pɔ̃tɔ ai sisɨn ni aru Ɗalapa ruubiini, a yasiyikɛ sisɨn kɔ̃linɛ, nɛ n ɗayi pɛlikɛ vigbete shɔ tɔnɛyi pɛli ɓayɛ. <verse eid="ROM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29" />I yalitɛ vitɛ ai sisɨn nɔ̃shɛ-nɔ̃shɛ, naa sisɨn lanɛ, vikɔ̃linɛ, vi ãanɛ, shɔ sãnɛ sisɨn, a nɔɔ taanɛ a shɔ vi, i sisɨn jo gɨn kaanɛ kpai, vɔrɔ nyɔnɛ, nya masinɛ, shɔ ɗakinɛ a shɔ zɔnɛni. <verse eid="ROM 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30" />a vikɔ̃linɛ shanɛ a zɔyuu; i bẽẽ Ɗalapa tɔ, i zɛ shɔɓa a shɛntiyuuniɓa, i tuu yuu bang, i basi bang; i kãli nyaba vikɔ̃linɛ pɛlinɛ bang; i weshoɓa a ɓeyeyi nyani ɓa; <verse eid="ROM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31" />I lerinɛ ɓa tɔ̃vɨn ɓa; i sã vigbete ayi maa a shɔni ɓa, i ɔri shɔ ruubii ɓa, gɨn kɔyiɓa a shɔni ɓa ko a shɔ raa ntanɛni ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32" />I zɛ tɛttɔ nɛ Ɗalapa nya ãsinɛ shanɛ shɔgbeteyi pɛlivim nɛi nto vɔnɛ. Ɓanɛ vim pɛlinɛ kɔshɛɓa, nɛ shɔu kɛ pɔ̃ naa nɛ nɛ shɔu pɛlitɔyɛ piti.<verse eid="ROM 1:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ɗalapa Ruu Yeenɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1" />Masayi ɔ yɛ yeeri zɔ ruutɔ a yuuniya? Ɔ nyaba naa raanɛ ɓa ko fɛ̃ɛ̃ ko ɔ piya. Akɛ yeeri shɔwɔɔ ruunɛ yuu, akɛ pɛli vigbete shɔu pɛli sɔ̃nnɛjo, si a lɛsɔ yuutɛ. <verse eid="ROM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2" />U zɛtɛttɔ Ɗalapa ruunɛ yeenɛ pɛ tɔ̃vɨn a shɔgbete i pɛli vim nankɔ yɛ ni. <verse eid="ROM 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3" />Ama mɔkɔ masa, a pɛli vigbete a yeeri shɔwɔyi ruu yuuyɛ sɔ̃njo! A zɛ naa a yɛ ranaatɔ a Ɗalapa ruuyeenɛ niya? <verse eid="ROM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4" />Ko a bẽẽ Ɗalapa bɔrɔɔ vitɔ̃vɨng gbete pɛli yɛ, au sisɨn mɛnɛ, a yɛti zazza gbete pɛli a yuumitɔ ya? Ɔ zɛtɛttɔ nizɛ kɔ Ɗalapa vipɛlinɛ pɛ tɔ̃vɨn, aru gbete u ɗɔɔ nyaba kãnɛ gbete yɛ sɨnrɛ ɔ yaa ruuviniyɛ. <verse eid="ROM 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5" />Ama ɔ sisɨn lakinɛ katara-katara, aru nankɔ ɔ ɗɔgbete pɛliyɛnɛ ɔ yukɔnɛ u ɔ̃ pẽnɛba a lee gbete Ɗalapa sisɨn gɨnvɔ̃ au vitɔ̃vɨng pɛlinɛ au ruuyeenɛyini shɔyɛ tasitɔ a ɓili. <verse eid="ROM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6" />Aru gbetenkɔ Ɗalapa yɛ shori ko-piya vi ɗɔnwanɛjo nɔgbete sho viyɛ. <verse eid="ROM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7" />Shɔ gãsi i ɓejo a ɗɔɔ vi tɔ̃vɨn pɛlinɛ, i kã bassinɛ a kutinɛ, a vitɔ̃vɨng pɛlinle; a Ɗalapa yɛ ãi Suru gbete sɔ̃ nyaɓayɛ. <verse eid="ROM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8" />Zɔgãsi i kasi ba i yuu i bẽẽ nyaba tɔ̃vɨntɔ, i kasinɛ nɗa i gɨn vigbete ɓa tɔ̃vɨn ɓayɛ; Ɗalapa yɛ nɔsiu sisɨn gɨnvɔ̃ pẽnɛba ai yuukɔ. <verse eid="ROM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9" />A ɗɔwaakɔɔ shɔgbete i pɛli vi kɔ̃linɛ iyɛ ɓooraatɔ a kɔnɛni, shɔyɛ gaa a Yahudawayi a pɛsi a shɔgbete i ɓa Yahudawaɓayɛ. <verse eid="ROM 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10" />Ama shɔgbete kɛ pɛli vitɔ̃vɨng nɛ Ɗalapa yɛ ãu basinɛtɔ, a kutinɛ, a ɔ̃nɛ yɛti puru, Yahudawayikɔ a ɗekɨn yɛnɛ sɔ̃n shɔgbete i ɓa Yahudawaɓa. <verse eid="ROM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11" />Ɗalapa yeeri shɔ ruu ji nagbetenkɔ piti kpai.<verse eid="ROM 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12" />Shɔgbeteyi ɓa Yahudawaɓa i ɓa a nya ãsinɛ Musa ni ɓa; Ama i pɛli ruuvinitɛ i nitɛ ka nyaãsinɛni. Yahudawayikɔ i nya ãsinɛ ɗɔn; ikɛ pɛli ruuvininɛ Ɗalapa yeeriyi ruujo a nyaba nya ãsinɛ Musakɔ. <verse eid="ROM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13" />Ɓa nya ãsinɛ Musakɔ ntanɛ yɛ sɨnrɛ shɔu ɔ̃ shɔ tɔ̃vɨn a Ɗalapa ɗekɨn ni ɓa, ama setɛ a pɛli vigbete nya ãsinɛ Musau shayɛtɛ. <verse eid="ROM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14" />Shɔgbete i ɓa Yahudawa ɓa i ɓa a nya ãsinɛ Musani ɓa; ama ikɛ shɔvinɛ a Musa nya ãsinɛni a sisɨn gbikiri gbikiri, i tu ɓɛji naayi i nya ãsinɛukɔ, ko i nya ãsinɛ ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15" />I vipɛlinɛ tasitɛ nɛ shɔ bee nya ãsinɛu tɛttɔ ai sisɨnni. I sisɨn tasiyi tɛttɔ nɛ vimpɛ nizɛ, lewɔɔ i sisɨn wiliyitɔ nɛ iji pɛli viɓa tɔ̃vɨn ɓa, lewɔɔ sɔ̃n raitɔ nɛi pɛli vitɔ̃vɨng. <verse eid="ROM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16" />Aruumkɔ, nagbete ruutɔ̃vɨng gbete n nwayɛ, vimyɛ ɔ̃ ji nankɔ aɗagbete Ɗalapa a Yesɔ Kirisi kabii yɛ yeerɔɔ ruu gbete shɔ ɓusi a sisɨntɔ piti kpai.<verse eid="ROM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yahudawayi a Musa Nya Ãsinɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17" />Ɔ sha kɛnɛ ivi awɔ yuuni viya? Ɔ ɓawɔɔ yuunɛ shɔ Yahudawa; ɔ pɔ̃ sisɨn a Musa nya sisɨn, ɔ basi a Ɗalapani; <verse eid="ROM 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18" />Ɔ zɛ vigbete Ɗalapa kasinɛ ɔ pɛliyɛ tɛttɔ, ɔ mati vi tɛttɔ a nya ãsinɛni gbete yɛ sɨnrɛ ɔ lɔɔ vitɔ̃vɨng; <verse eid="ROM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19" />Ɔ zɛ tɛtɔ ɔ pɛ shɔ gbete ɔ tasi shɔ nɔgbãtiyi nyabayɛ, ɔ pɛ ɗɔsẽsẽ a shɔ ɗɔkɨnriyi bini ni, <verse eid="ROM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20" />a shɔgbete i geli shɔ rãnyi ruuyɛ, a shɔmala gbete i mati shɔgbete i ji zɛ ruuɓayɛ vi. Ɔ zɛtɛttɔ nizɛ kɔ a Musa nya ãsinɛ kpai ruutɔ̃vɨng zɛnɛ a tɔ̃vɨn ni aɗɔn. <verse eid="ROM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21" />Ɔ mati shɔwɔɔ vi ɔ mati ɔ yuu ɓɛ ji ɓa aruuviya? Ɔ nwari shɔ nyanɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔkɔ ɓoo vinɛ&gt;&gt; ama ɔ ɓoo vi ɓaya? <verse eid="ROM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22" />Ɔ shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔkɔ pɛli kpantanɛ&gt;&gt; ama ɔ pɛli kpantang ɓaya? Ɔ bɛ̃ɛ vigãnkitɔ ama ɔ raa vi ɓa a wɛrɛ Ɗa ni ɓaya? <verse eid="ROM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23" />Ɔ basinɛ nɛ i Ɗalapa nya ãsinɛ aɗɔn ama ɔ n ti yusẽe ɓa a Ɗalapani a tete gbete ɔ bẽẽ u nya ãsinɛ tɔɓa? <verse eid="ROM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24" />Ɗanyaruubii shanɛ, &lt;&lt;A wɔɔ yuukɔ ɔ shɔ Yahudawayi, shɔgbete i ɓa Yahudawa ɓa i sha vikɔ̃linɛ a Ɗa yuu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25" />Ɔ kɛ gɨn nya ãsinɛ nɛ, ɔ sha yeenɛ ukɔ vitɔ̃vɨng; ama naa ɔkɛ bẽẽ nya ãsinɛ Musa nɛ, ɔ̃ naa shɔgbete shɔji yereiyi shaa ɓayɛ. <verse eid="ROM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26" />Naa shɔgbetei ɓa Yahudawaɓa, a shɔji yeeriyi shaa ɓa ikɛ gɨn vigbete nya ãsinɛ shayɛnɛ, Ɗalapa yɛ pɔ̃i ɓa a tete shɔgbete shɔ yeeriyi shayɛtɛ ɓaya? <verse eid="ROM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27" />Aru gbetenkɔ ɔ shɔ Yahudawayi, shɔgbete i ɓa Yahudawaɓa iyɛ yeerɔɔ ruu aru gbete shɔ beerɔɔ nya ãsinɛ Musa tɛttɔ shɔ yeerɔɔ shaa sɔ̃n tɛttɔ; ama i gɨn nya ãsinɛtɔ, ko shɔji yeeriyi shaa ɓa naa gbete shɔ yeeriuyɛ ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28" />A vimni piti kpai, shɔu upɛ gaanɛ Yahudawa a shɔ yeeriu shaatɛ nizɛ yɛ piya? Ɓanɛ shɔgbete u pɛ shɔ Yahudawa a bi ɓiliyɛ, shɔgbete u shaa yeenɛ pɛ vi zɛnɛ. <verse eid="ROM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29" />Ɓa, shɔ Yahudawa tɔ̃vɨn ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔgbete au kɔsi sisɨntɛ, ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔgbete shɔ yeeriu shaa tɛyɛ, shɔmpɛ Ɗalapa Suru vishonɛ, ɓa nya ãsinɛ gbete Musa beeyɛ ɓa. Shɔm ukɔ tɛɛ bɛlinɛ rɛ a Ɗa naa, ɓanɛ shɔzɛ naa ɓa.<verse eid="ROM 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1" />Shɔ Yahudawayi i tɛɛ shɔgbete i ɓa Yahudawa ɓayɛ kɛtɔya? Ko vitɔ̃vɨng kɛpi ivi a shaa yeenɛ ni viya? <verse eid="ROM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2" />Nizɛ kɔ vikpaanɛ bangtɔ ko-pi nyaba shopiya! A gaanɛ, Ɗalapa ã shɔ Yahudawayi u nyaruubii a naa nɛi sãtɔ. <verse eid="ROM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3" />Ama nɗa i gãsi i ji ɔ̃ ɓa shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ ɓa fa? Shɔmyɛ tasi kɛ nɛ Ɗalapa tɔ̃vɨn kɛ ɓa ɗɔn ɓaya? <verse eid="ROM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4" />Ɓa nizɛ kɔ ɓa! Ɗalapa u pɛ tɔ̃vɨn, ko-pi shɔzɛ gbete piya i shɔ nyazɔ̃. Ji naa gbete Ɗalapa nyaruubii shayɛ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:4">&lt;&lt;Ɔ̃ raatɛ kaka jazɨ akɔrɔ, naa akɛ nwanyanɛ shɔu zɛ ji nɛ vigbete a sham pɛ nizɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:4">Ɔ̃ tɛ kaka jazɨ aa kɔrɔɔ a shaajo vitɔ̃vɨng auyɛ raa yuu naa shɔkɛ hɨlaa ruunɛyɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5" />Ama naa u vipɛlinɛ gbete kɔ̃linɛ kɛ tasi nɛ a ɓili nɛ Ɗalapa vipɛlinɛ pɛ tɛpɛ-tɛpɛ, u yɛ shakɛnɛ iviya? U yɛ shakɛnɛ Ɗalapa yeeriu ruu a yuu ji pɛliɓa tɔ̃vɨn ɓaya? (Ko-piya yɛ hɨ ruumtɔ) <verse eid="ROM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6" />Ɓa ɗɔkɔ ɓa! Si tɔnɛn ɔ̃ nankɔ, Ɗalapa yɛ yeeri shɔ ruu kɛpi kovi a koo ni viya?<verse eid="ROM 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7" />Shɔwɔ yɛ shanɛ, naa n nyazɔ̃ kɛ sɨ Ɗalapa bassinɛ nɛ kɛ shɛnɛ a ɓili wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ, ɔ yeerin ruu dɔdɔrim kɛpi aru ivi nɛn shɔruuvini viya? <verse eid="ROM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8" />Ɔ ji shakɛ ɓa aru vi ne,&lt;&lt;U pɛlijo vikɔ̃linɛ nɔgbete u kpaa vi tɔ̃vɨn ɓaya?&gt;&gt; Shɔ gãsiyi ɗɔgbete i lɛsiu niiyɛ, nɛ u shali vimtɛ nizɛ! Shɔ yɛ yeeri shɔmiyi ruu ji naa vigbete i pɛliyɛ.<verse eid="ROM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shɔwɔ Ji Pɛli Vitɔ̃vɨng Biɓa Kɔ gbete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9" />Nizɛ kɔ uyɛ shakɛnɛ viya, &lt;&lt;U shɔ Yahudawayi u tɛɛ shɔgbete i ɓa Yahudawaɓayɛ kɛtɔ ya?&gt;&gt; Ɓa nankɔ ɓa! N tasi tɛttɔ nɛ Yahudawa a shɔgbeteyi i ɓa Yahudawa ɓa, i pɛli ruuvini tɛttɔ piti kpai. <verse eid="ROM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10" />Nagbete Ɗanyaruubii shayɛ nɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:10">Shɔwɔ ɓa ɗɔn nɛn pɛ shɔ tɔ̃vɨn ɓa,<verse eid="ROM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11" />Shɔwɔ ɓa ɗɔn nɛn pɛ shɔ sẽrẽe ɓa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:11">Ko nɛn shɔ Ɗa bassinɛ ɓa.<verse eid="ROM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12" />I piti kpai i risi Ɗalapa kntitɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">i pɛli vikɔ̃linɛtɛ kpai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">shɔwɔ ji pɛli vitɔ̃vɨng ɓa, ko gbete.<verse eid="ROM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13" />I kɨnkɔrɔ naa saa gbete ɓelinɛ yɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:13">I vigbete shɛ ai rɛti yɛ pɛ nyayeelinɛkɔ sheeli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:13">i nyanwanɛ pɔ̃ shɔ seti naa pudu zũpɔ̃ ai ganyani.<verse eid="ROM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14" />i yeeti nya ɓala-ɓala.<verse eid="ROM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15" />I lɛsi shɔ sisɨn tẽẽti a nyɔ shɔ vɔrɔ;<verse eid="ROM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16" />ɗɔgbete i kɛ sɔnɛ setɛ i lɛsivitɛ ɗɔgbete i yɛ piti kpai.<verse eid="ROM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17" />I ji zɛ nyaba sisɨn puru ɔ̃nɛ ɓa,<verse eid="ROM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18" />ko i mati nɔgbete i bassi Ɗalapa yɛ ɓa.<verse eid="ROM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19" />Dɔdɔrim u zɛtɛttɔnɛ vigbete a Musa nya ãsinɛ shovi ɓɛjo a shɔgbeteyi gɨnyɛ yuu, aru gbete u zãri shɔ nya walinɛ u n ti Ɗa ruuyeenɛ a shɔ yuu piti kpai. <verse eid="ROM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20" />Shɔwɔ yɛ ɔ̃ ɓa a Ɗalapa ɗekɨn nɛ ruugbete nɛn gɨn nya ãsinɛ ɓa; vigbete nya ãsinɛ pɛliyɛ nɛu zɛtɔ u pɛli ruuvinitɛ.<verse eid="ROM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Atette sisɨn ãnɛ u kpaa ɔ̃ a Ɗalapani ɗekɨn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21" />Ama dɔdɔrim ɓa tete Musa nya ãsinɛ niɓa, Ɗalapa tasi shɔ nyaba gbete au pɔ̃ shɔ u ɔ̃ au ɗekɨn yɛtɛ, ko Musa nya ãsinɛ janyagadi i nwanyatɛ au yuuni. <verse eid="ROM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22" />Ɗalapa pɔ̃ shɔ tɔ̃vɨn a tete sisɨn ãnɛ a Yesɔ Kirisi kabii. Ɗa pɛli vim piti kpai aru gbete shɔu kɛ ã sisɨn nɛ a Kirisi biiyɛ, aru gbete vɔsinɛ ɓa a tɛttɛ niɓa: <verse eid="ROM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23" />ko-piya pɛli ruuvinitɛ u ɓa a Ɗalapa bassinɛ maani ni ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24" />Ama au ruu vitɔ̃vɨng gbete ã shɔyɛ ukɔ pɔ̃ shɔrɛ a Yesɔ Kirisi kabii, shɔu raa shɔyɛ. <verse eid="ROM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25" />Ɗalapa ã Yesɔ kirisirɛ nɛu ɔ̃ viyuu ãnɛ u tusu shɔruuvini, aru kpaa gbete ntee nɗa shɔu sɔ̃ri shɔgbete ã sisɨn au biiyɛ ruuvinitɔ. Ɗalapa pɛli vim aru u tasinɛ u vishonɛ pɛ tɔ̃vɨn. Si tẽẽ-tẽẽ Ɗalapa mee sisɨn pɛtɔ jo gashɔ ruuvini ɓa; ama dɔdɔrim shɔvitɔ a shɔ ruuvini u yeeri ruu ayuu, nɔgbete u tasi shɔ a ɓili nɛn pɛ shɔ tɔ̃vɨn. <verse eid="ROM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26" />Pɛli vim ɗɔkɔ aru u tasi u vitɔ̃vɨng pɛlinɛ a ɗauni, aru u ɔ̃ tɛpɛ -tɛpɛ a shɔ gbete pɛlinɛ vitɔ̃vɨng a sisɨn ãnɛ a Yesɔ kirisi biiyɛ. <verse eid="ROM 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27" />U yɛ basi kɛ ruu iviya? Viwɔɔ ɓa! Vim kɛpi aru iviya? Kɛ ruu gbete u gɨn nya ãsinɛyɛ ya? Ɓa, ama aru gbete u ã sisɨn a Yesɔ kirisi bi. <verse eid="ROM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28" />Au nya yisin nɛ shɔgbete kɛ ɔ̃nɛ a Ɗalapa ɗekɨn si ɔ̃ ɓɛjo au ruu sisɨn ãnɛ ko sheeli, ɓa naa ruugbete nya ãsinɛ shayɛ ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29" />Ko Ɗalapa upɛ Yahudawayi Ɗalapakɔ sheeli ya? U ɓa shɔgbeteyi i ɓa Yahudawaɓa Ɗalapa ɓaya? Nizɛ u jiyi Ɗalapakɔ. <verse eid="ROM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30" />Ɗalapa upɛ gbete, ukɔ yɛ pɔ̃ Yahudawayi i ɔ̃ au ɗekɨn ji nɔgbete i ã sisɨnyɛ, yɛ pɔ̃ shɔgbete i ɓa Yahudawa ɓa i ɔ̃ sɔ̃njo au ɗekɨn ji nɔgbete ai ã sisɨn yɛ. <verse eid="ROM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31" />Aru sisɨn ãnɛmkɔ u yɛ gɨn nya ãsinɛm tokɨn ɓaya? Ɓa, ɓa ɗɔkɔ ɓa; aru nankɔ u sã nya ãsinɛ naa kaziti.<verse eid="ROM 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4" />
  <para style="s1">Vigbete Ibirayi pɛliyɛ u tasinɛ nɛ upɛ shɔ nya ãsinɛ gɨnnɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1" />U yɛ shakɛnɛ ivi a Ibirayi yuuni gbete upɛ u ɓɛuru ni viya? Kɛɗɔn ɔ kãkɛ ivi zɛnɛ aru vimiyi ni viya? <verse eid="ROM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2" />Naa Ibirayi kɛ kpaa ɔ̃nɛ nɛ a Ɗalapa ɗekɨn au ruu vishonɛ gbete pɛliyɛ, u viwɔɔ siyɛ ɔ̃ ɗɔn gbete si basi a wuniyɛ, ama ɓa Ɗa ɗekɨn ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3" />Ɗalapa labeenɛ shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Ibirayi ã sisɨntɔ a Ɗalapa biini, au ruu sisɨn ãnɛkɔ Ɗalapa tɛu naarɛ nɛu ɔ̃ shɔ tɔ̃vɨn.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4" />Shɔgbete au kɛ shovinɛ shɔ shoriu vi ɗɔnwanɛtɔ, ama saa gbete shɔ shoruyɛ ɓa vi ãnɛ weze ɓa; shɔ shoru ji au ruu viyɔnɛ. <verse eid="ROM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5" />Ama shɔgbete ai pɔ̃ yuu a a sisɨn ãnɛ, ɓanɛ aru vipɛlinɛ ɓa, a shɔu kɛ ã sisɨn nɛ a Ɗalapa gbete teenɛ shɔgbete pɛli vikɔ̃linɛ nɛu pɛ shɔ tɔ̃vɨn, Ɗalapa tuu jo u sisɨn ãnɛmkɔ shovirɛ awuni nɛi ɔ̃ a nyazɔ a wuni. <verse eid="ROM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6" />N pɛ vigbete Dauda nwanya aru shɔ vɔ susãsri tasinɛ abi gbete Ɗalapa tɛirɛ nɛi pɛ shɔ vitɔ̃vɨng pɛlinɛyi, ɓa a tete vigbete shɔzɛyi pɛliyɛ ɓa:<verse eid="ROM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7" />&lt;&lt;Vɔ u tasi shɔgbete a shɔ yasiyi ruuvini tɛyɛ susãri abiini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:7">shɔ gbete shɔ sɔ̃riyi ruuviniyɛ!<verse eid="ROM 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8" />Vɔ u tasi shɔgbete au Uɓeyelapa yɛ gau ruuvini ɓayɛ susãri abiini!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9" />Vɔ susãri gbete Dauda nwanya au yuuni mi ji shɔ Yahudawayi ɓɛkɔ sheeli ya? Ɓa, ɓa ɗɔkɔɓa. Ji a shɔgbete i ɓa Yahudawaɓa ni piti kpai. Vigbete au shayɛ shɔ bee tɛttɔ nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ibirayi ã sisɨn tɛttɔ a Ɗa bi ni, au ruu sisɨn ãnɛmkɔ Ɗalapa tɛurɛ nɛu ɔ̃ shɔ vipɛlinɛ tɔ̃vɨn.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10" />Shɔ pɛli vim pi ɗaviya? Shɔ pɛli a ɗagbete ko a knti gbete shɔ yeeri Ibirayi shaa yɛ ya? Shɔ pɛli aɗagbete shɔ yeeriu shaa yɛ ɓau knti shaa yeerin ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11" />Ibirayi shaa yeenɛ si a knti, u shaa yeenɛu sipɛ vigbete yɛ tasinɛ u sisɨn ãnɛ ukɔ sɨnrɛ Ɗalapa tɛu naa nɛ u ɔ̃ shɔgbete au pɛli vitɔ̃vɨng nɗa shɔu yeeriu shaa kɛkn. Arumkɔ Ibirayi ukɔ pɛ shɔgbeteyi ã sisɨn a Ɗa biiyɛ i ɓeye a tɛtte suru, a Ɗa tɛi naa a pɔ̃nɛ i ɔ̃ shɔ vitɔ̃vɨng pɛlinɛ au ɗekɨn, ko shɔji yeeriyi shaa ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12" />Ukɔ sɔ̃n ji shɔgbete shɔji yeeriyi shaa ɓayɛ i ɓeye, i kɔ ɔ̃rɛ a shɔ ɓasiyi sɔ̃n a shɔgbete shɔ yeeriyi shaa yɛ, i ɔ̃ sɔ̃njo naa uɓeye Ibirayi ɔ̃ siji ɔ̃nɛ sisɨn ãnɛ aɗagbete shɔji yeeriu shaa ɓayɛ.<verse eid="ROM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɗalapa Ruu Maanɛ Shɔ tɛɛ atette Sisɨn Ãnɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13" />Naa Ɗalapa maa ruu tɛ a Ibirayi ni au shɔ laduruyini nɛ koo tipi yɛ ɔ̃ u ɓɛɛ, pɛli nankɔ, ɓanɛ aru gbete Ibirayi gɨn nya ãsinɛ yɛ ɓa, ama ɓɛji ruugbete ã sisɨntɔ a Ɗalapa biini a Ɗalapa tɛu naa nɛu ɔ̃ naa shɔu pɛli vitɔ̃vɨng au dɛkɨn yɛ. <verse eid="ROM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14" />Aru Ɗalapa si tɔnɛ maa ruu nɛn ã shɔgbete i gɨn nya ãsinɛyɛ, kɛɗɔn sisɨn ãnɛ si ɓa viwɔɔ ɓa, Ɗalapa ruu maanɛ si ɔ̃ wati. <verse eid="ROM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15" />Nya ãsinɛ n ti Ɗalapa sisɨn lɛsinɛ; ama ɗɔgbete nya ãsinɛ ɓa ɗɔn ɓa, shɔ bẽẽ nya ãsinɛ ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16" />Ruu maanɛ shɔ maa jo a nɔgbete shɔ ã sisɨnyɛ, aru gbete ruu maanɛ u ɔ̃kɛ Ɗalapa vi ãnɛ gbete au ã Ibirayi shɔ laduruyi piti kpai wezɛyɛ, Ɓanɛ aru shɔgbete i gɨn Musa nya ãsinɛ kɔ sheeli ɓa, ama sɔ̃njo aru shɔgbete i ã sisɨn naa Ibirayi ã yɛ. Nagbete Ibirayi kɔ ɔ̃rɛ uɓeye a Suru piti kpai; <verse eid="ROM 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17" />nagbete Ɗalapa nya ruubii shayɛnɛ, &lt;&lt;N pɔ̃tɛ a ɔ̃ shɔ laduru waanɛ i ɓeyeyi.&gt;&gt; Kɛɗɔn ruu maanɛu ɔ̃kɛ tɔ̃vɨn a Ɗalapa kabiini, a shɔgbete Ibirayi ã sisɨn au bi ni yɛ Ɗalapa shɔgbete au n ti shɔgbete i vɔtɛttɔ a Suruni yɛ a shɔgbete u nya ãsinɛ n ti vigbete si ɓa ɗɔm ɓayɛ. <verse eid="ROM 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18" />Ibirayi ã sisɨn a pɔ̃ yuu ɗɔn, ko sijo ɗagbete viyuu pɔ̃ si ɓa, a ɔ̃ kɛkn &lt;&lt; laduru waanɛyi ɓeye.&gt;&gt; Ji naa Ɗalapa nyaruubii shayɛ, &lt;&lt;A laduru iyɛ ɔ̃ naa sɛ a kulapa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19" />U kpẽnɛ si saa mɛnɛ laa maani; ama sisɨn ãnɛ ji kɔsi ɓa naa zɛtɛ nɛn kpẽtɛ, gbete si u biu vɔtɛtɔ gboti, aru gbete Sera u si sutɔ̃ri ji kpaa jaa ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20" />Ji vɔsi ɓa au sisɨn ãnɛ ni ɓa, ji lɛri ɓa au sisɨn ãnɛ Ɗalapa ruu maanɛ yɛ pɛli ɓa ɓa; u sisɨn ãnɛ lakiu kaka bitɔ, a bɛli Ɗalaparɛ. <verse eid="ROM 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21" />Si zɛtɛttɔ au sisɨnni nɛ Ɗalapa yɛ pɛli vigbete maa a wuni yɛ dɔɔtɔ. <verse eid="ROM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22" />Si jo arumkɔ Ibirayi au tɛttɛ sisɨn ãnɛ,&lt;&lt;Ɗalapa tɛurɛ nɛ u pɛ shɔ vipɛlinɛ tɔ̃vɨn au ɗekɨn.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23" />Nya nwanɛ gbete shɔ shanɛ,&lt;&lt;shɔ tɛurɛ nɛ upɛ shɔ vipɛlinɛ tɔ̃vɨn a Ɗalapa ɗekɨn&gt;&gt;shɔ ji bee ɓa au yuukɔ sheeli ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24" />Shɔ beeri sɔ̃n ji ukɔ shɔgbete shɔyɛ tɛi yɛ nɛ i pɛ shɔ vipɛlinɛ tɔ̃vɨn a Ɗalapa ɗekɨn, shɔgbete ai ã sisɨn au bi yɛ nɛ ukɔ yusi Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ a suruni a saa. <verse eid="ROM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25" />Au ruuvini kɔ shɔ ãu naa nɛu vɔtɔ, a shɔ yusiu laparɛ a suruni u pɔ̃u a Ɗalapa ɗɔbii.<verse eid="ROM 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5" />
  <para style="s1">Tɔ̃vɨn Ɔ̃nɛ a Ɗalapa ɗekɨn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1" />Dɔdɔrim u ɔ̃ tɛ a Ɗalapa ɗekɨn a tɛttɛ sisɨn ãnɛ, u ɔ̃nɛ binyatɔ̃nɛ a Ɗalapani a kaa Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi. <verse eid="ROM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2" />Ɗalapa a nyaba sisɨn ãnɛ n-titɛ u kpaa vishonɛ tɔ̃vɨn au kabii, gbete dɔdɔrim u ɔ̃tɛm. Aru gbetenkɔ u ɓasi kɛkn a sisɨn pɔ̃nɛ a vigbete u yɛ kpaa a yɛti Ɗalapa bassinɛ yɛ! <verse eid="ROM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3" />U baasi wɔ sɔ̃njo au yɛti raɓoonɛ, aru gbete u zɛ tɛttɔ raɓoonɛ n ti sisɨnmanɛ, Ɓa ukɔ sheeli ɓa, u ɗɔgbete u nta tɔ̃vɨn au yɛti raaɓonɛ, aru gbete u zɛ tɛttɔ nɛ raaɓonɛ ukɔ n ti gɨn maanɛrɛ, <verse eid="ROM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4" />gɨn maanɛ ukɔ pɔ̃rɛ Ɗalapa sɨ naa a shɔ vishonɛ, au naa sɨnɛkɔ n ti sisɨn pɔ̃nɛrɛ. <verse eid="ROM 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5" />Sisɨn pɔ̃nɛm yɛ ɗakiu ɓa, Ɗalapa tẽeriu ɔrinɛ tɛttɔ au sisɨn piti kpai a kaa Suru wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ gbete Ɗalapa ãu yɛ. <verse eid="ROM 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6" />Aɗagbete u shɔ naa pɔ̃sinɛ si ɓa, Kirisi vɔ shɔ lanɛyi yuu aɗagbete Ɗalapa lɔɔ yɛ. <verse eid="ROM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7" />Ɓa vi pɛlaa ɓa shɔwɔɔ u vɔ a shɔgbete pɛli vitɔ̃vɨng yuu yɛ ɓa. Ko wɔɔ ɓa shɔwɔɔ yɛ zɛnɔ pɛlinɛ tɔ u vɔ a shɔgbete pɛli vitɔ̃vɨng yɛ yuu. <verse eid="ROM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8" />Ama Ɗalapa tasiu nɔgbete au ɔriuyɛ tɛttɔ sidi jo ɗagbete u doo shɔ ruuvini Kirisi vɔ au yuu! <verse eid="ROM 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9" />Nagbete u kpaa ɔ̃nɛ tɛ a Ɗalapa ɗekɨn au ruu kpaa gbete tɛɛyɛ, u yɛ kpaa naa ranɛ yisinɛ kɛpi kovi a Ɗalapa yɛti lɛsinɛ ni vi au kabii ni viya? <verse eid="ROM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10" />U sipɛ Ɗalapa shɔnɔpɔ̃, ama risiutɛ ɓɛsa a tete ɓɛjaa vɔrɔ. Dɔdɔrim naa au ritɛ Ɗalapa ɓɛsam, shɔyɛ rau yisinɛ kɛpi kovi a Kirisi suru ni viya! <verse eid="ROM 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11" />Ama Pɛ ɓa shɔmkɔ kpai ɓa, u ɗɔ binyatɔ̃nɛ ntanɛ aru vigbete Ɗalapa pɛliyɛ a kaa Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi, shɔgbete au dɔdɔrim risiu Ɗalapa ɓɛsayi.<verse eid="ROM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adam A Kirisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12" />Ruuvini a kotipim a shɔzɛ gbete yuu, a u ruuvini n ti vɔnɛ. Aru vimkɔ vɔrɔ ɔ̃tɛ shɔ yuu piti aru gbete shɔ pɛli ruuvinitɛ kpai. <verse eid="ROM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13" />Ruuvini si jo a kooni a ɗagbete shɔ ã nyaãsinɛyɛ; ama aɗɔgbete nyaãsinɛ siɓa ɗɔmɓayɛ, si shɔ ji ga ruuvini ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14" />Ama yunɛ ɗagbete Adam yɛnɛ a Musa bi, vɔrɔ roo kpati a shɔzɛ yuu piti kpai, a shɔgbete i jo pɛli ruuvini ɓa a nyaba gbete Adam pɛliyɛ au bɛsi Ɗalapa nya gbete ãsiyɛ. Adam ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ naa jasuru kirisi gbete yɛ a yɛ. <verse eid="ROM 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15" />Ama shɔzɛ zitimiyi i ɓa gbete ɓa, aru gbete Ɗalapa vi ãnɛ ɓa naa Adam ruuvini ɓa. Sipɛ nizɛ shɔzɛ waanɛ i vɔli aru shɔzɛ gbetenkɔ ruuvini. Ama Ɗalapa vitɔ̃vɨng pɛlinɛ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ pẽnɛba, ji nankɔ au vitɔ̃vɨng gbete ã shɔyɛ ni a kaa shɔzɛ gbete, Yesɔ Kirisi. <verse eid="ROM 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16" />A ɗɔwakɔ vɔsinɛ ɗɔn a tete Ɗalapa vi ãnɛ a shɔzɛ gbete ruuvini. Akɨnti shɔzɛ gbete ruuvini Adam, kɛ ruu yeenɛ a yuu &lt;&lt;Ruuvini&gt;&gt;; ama akɨnti ruuvini bang mi, vigbete Yesɔ ãuyɛ pɔ̃ Ɗalaparɛ &lt;&lt;sɨu au ɗekɨn.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17" />Nizɛ kɔ a tete ruuvini gbete shɔzɛ pɛliyɛ vɔrɔ gaa kpati roonɛ kɨn aru vi a shɔzɛ gbete pɛliyɛ. Ama vigbete shɔzɛ gbetem pɛliyɛ u banɛ yɛ ɔ̃ kɛpikoviya? Yesɔ Kirisi! Shɔgbete yi kɛ tɛ Ɗalapa vi ãnɛ tɔ̃vɨn nɛ piti au pɔ̃rɛ i ɔ̃ a wuni, iyɛ roo kpati a Yesɔ Kirisi kabii. <verse eid="ROM 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18" />Kɛɗɔn naa shɔzɛ gbete Adam ruuvini n ti ruu yeenɛ a shɔ yuu piti kpai, sɔ̃nji nyabankɔ a shɔzɛ gbete au pɛli vitɔ̃vɨng yɛ raashɔ piti kpai yɛ ãyi kɛ suru. <verse eid="ROM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19" />Ji nagbete a shɔzɛ gbete yuu shɔ ɔ̃ shɔ ruuvini piti kpai aru gbete au bɛsi Ɗalapa nya, sɔ̃nji nyabankɔ shɔyɛ pɔ̃rɛ i ɔ̃ a Ɗalapa ɗekɨn a shɔzɛ gbete yuu Yesɔ kirisi. <verse eid="ROM 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20" />Ɗalapa ã Musa nya ãsinɛm nɛ shɔ zɛ ruuvini u ɔ̃ Kɔ̃linɛ; ama ɗɔgbete ruuvini shaɗɔn yɛ, Ɗalapa vipɛlinɛ tɔ̃vɨn sha sɔ̃njo bang. <verse eid="ROM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21" />Nagbete ruuvini roo kpati u nyɔ shɔ vɔrɔ piti kpai, Ɗa roo kpati sɔ̃njo nankɔ aru vitɔ̃vɨng pɛlinɛ yɛ pɔ̃ shɔu ɔ̃ ɔ̃nɛ tɔ̃vɨn a Ɗalapa ɗekɨn, au n ti nɛu kpaa suru gbete sɔ̃nyaɓayɛ a kaa Yesɔ Kirisi Uɓeyelapa.<verse eid="ROM 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6" />
  <para style="s1">Suru sɔɔ kpaanɛ a Kirisi bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1" />Kɛɗɔn u yɛ shakɛnɛ iviya? U yɛ ɗekɨn a ruuvini pɛlinɛ ni aru Ɗalapa vitɔ̃vɨng pɛlinɛ u shakɛtɔ ya? <verse eid="ROM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2" />Nn, ɓa ɗɔkɔ ɓa! U shɔgbete u vɔ a ruuvini u yɛ ɔ̃ kɛpi kovi a yɛti ruuvini viya? <verse eid="ROM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3" />Aru ɔ ji zɛ ɓa nɛ shɔgbete shɔ pɛliu batizima a Yesɔ nii yɛ, shɔ pɛliu batizima u tasi nɛ u a Yesɔ Kirisi ni gbete. <verse eid="ROM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4" />Naa shɔ pɛliu Batizimatɛ, ɔ̃ kɛ naa shɔ gbãu a Kirisi ni nyazɔ a ɗagbete vɔyɛ, nagbete shɔ yusi Kirisi a saa yɛ au ɓeye bassinɛ, ukɔ ma u ɔ̃ sɔ̃njo a suru sɔɔ ni. <verse eid="ROM 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5" />Ji tẽẽ-tẽẽ u ɔ̃ gbete awuni au kaa vɔnɛ gbete vɔyɛ, ji nyabankɔ uyɛ ɔ̃gbete a wuni a kagbete yulapa a saa yɛ. <verse eid="ROM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6" />U zɛtɛttɔ u ɔ̃nɛ kpali, pɔ̃tɛ u vɔtɛ kirisi a kaa naa ɓanɛ laa, a nɔgbete kaka ruuvini gbete u pɛliyɛ u lɛsirɛ, aru uyɛ ɔ̃ jaa foo ruuvini tɔɓa. <verse eid="ROM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7" />Naa ukɛ vɔnɛ, siu raa naatɛ a ruuvini kakani. <verse eid="ROM 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8" />Nɔgbete u vɔ a Yesɔni, u ã sisɨntɛ u yɛ ɔ̃ sɔ̃njo a wuni. <verse eid="ROM 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9" />Nagbete u zɛ tɛttɔ Kirisi yulapatɛ a vɔnɛni yɛ vɔ tɔɓa vɔrɔyɛ roo kpati ɓa au yuuni ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10" />Ji nankɔ, aru gbete vɔtɛttɔ, vɔrɔ kaka tɔɓa au yuuni ɓa; a dɔdɔrim yɛ ɔ̃u ɔ̃nɛ a nyazɔ a Ɗalapani. <verse eid="ROM 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11" />Ji nankɔ a kpaa sisɨntɔ aa yuuni nɛmpɛ vɔrɔ, naa ruuvini ruubii ji nankɔ, ama ɔ ɔ̃ ɔ̃nɛ binyatɔ̃nɛ a Ɗalapani a kaa Kirisi Yesɔ kabii. <verse eid="ROM 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12" />Ɔ̃ tɛ kaka jazɨ awɔ kɔrɔ ɔkɔɔ yaa ruuvini nɛ u roo kpati awɔ bi gbete vɔtɔmini, kɛɗɔn nɗa a gɨn vigbete a bi kasiyɛ. <verse eid="ROM 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13" />Ɔ̃rɔɔtɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ ɔkɔ ã ruuvini &lt;&lt; kabii wɔɔnɛ aru vigɔ̃nlɔrɔ pɛlinɛni. Kɛ ɔ̃nɛ ɗɔkɔ ɔ ã yuu a Ɗalapa bi, naa shɔgbete shɔ yusiyi a vɔrɔ anɛ suru, a ã yuu piti kpai a Ɗalapa bi aru gbete u shɔ shovi tɔ̃vɨn a wuniyɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14" />Ruuvini ukɔ ɔ̃nɛ ɔ shɔwɛrɛ; ɔ ji ɔ̃ ɓa tɔ̃ɔ̃ Musa nya ãsinɛ ɓa ama ɔ ɔ̃ a Ɗalapa vitɔ̃vɨng pɛlinɛ.<verse eid="ROM 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jafoo ɔ̃nɛ Vitɔ̃vɨng Pɛlinɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15" />Kɛpi koviya? U pɛli kɛ ruuvini aru gbete Musa nya ãsinɛ u kaka ɓa au yuuni ɓa, see Ɗalapa vitɔ̃vɨng pɛlinɛ ya? Nyaba pɛlinɛ ɓa! <verse eid="ROM 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16" />Nizɛ kɔ ɔ zɛtɛttɔ ɔkɛ ã yuunɛ naa jafoo nɛn gɨn shɔwɔɔ nya, ɔ pɛ jafoo nizɛ kɔ a shɔwɛrɛ gbete ɔ gɨn u nyayɛ ɗɔbiini ko ruuvini, gbete yɛ sɨnrɛ ɔ vɔyɛ, ko shɔ nya gɨnnɛ, gbete yɛ pɔ̃rɛ ɔ ɔ̃ a Ɗalapani nyazɔ. <verse eid="ROM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17" />Ama dɔ̃rinɛ yɛnɛ Ɗalapa ɗekɨn! Ko aɗagbete ɔ sipɛ jafoo a ruuvini naani, ɔ gɨn nyautɛ a sisɨn ni piti kpai aru vitɔ̃vɨng gbete ɔ kpaa a yɛti vigbete shɔ matɔɔyɛ ɔ tɛyɛ. <verse eid="ROM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18" />Shɔ rawɔtɛ a ruuvini naani, ɔ rikɛtɛ jafoo a ruu vitɔ̃vɨng pɛlinɛ. <verse eid="ROM 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19" />(N shovi a nyakoo gbete shɔ nwa a lee-leeyɛ aru bi vɔnɛ gbete ɔ pɛli vikɔ̃linɛ awɔ biiyɛ.) A ɗawɔ ɔ piti kpai ɔ ã yuu naa jafoo aɗɔgbete ɔ pɛli vikɔ̃linɛ a lanɛni nɛ ruu vigɔ̃nlɔrɔ pɛlinɛ. Ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ dɔdɔrim ɔ ãwɔɔ yuu nɔgbete naa jafoo vitɔ̃vɨng pɛlinɛ aru wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ a Ɗalapa ɗekɨn. <verse eid="ROM 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20" />Naa ɔ si jafoo a ruuvini naa, ɔ yuu kɔnɛ si ɓa a vitɔ̃vɨng pɛlinɛni ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21" />Ɔ kpaakɛ ivi aru vikɔ̃linɛ gbete ɔ pɛliyɛ a dɔdɔrim ɔ nta yusẽe tɛ au yuunim viya? Vigbete ɔ pɛliyɛ piti kpai u nya yisinɛ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ vɔnɛ! <verse eid="ROM 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22" />Ama dɔdɔrim naa shɔ raawɔtɛ a ruuvini naani ɔ kɛ jafoo a Ɗalapa ɗekɨn. Vigbete ɔyɛ kpaa yɛ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ yuu ãnɛ au bi piti kpai, a u nya yisinɛ piti yɛ ɔ̃kɛ suru gbete yisi nya ɓayɛ. <verse eid="ROM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23" />Arumkɔ ruuvini shori shɔ vi ɗɔnwanɛ a vɔrɔ; ama vigbete Ɗalapa ã shɔ wezɛyɛ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ suru gbete sɔ̃ nya ɓayɛ a yuu ɓasi Kirisi Yesɔ Uɓeyelapa.<verse eid="ROM 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7" />
  <para style="s1">Vimatinɛ gbete u tɛɛ aru zɔ tɛnɛ yɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1" />Masayi ɔ shɔgbete ɔ zɛ nya-ãsinɛ gbete Musa mati shɔtɛttɔ, ɔ yɛ zɛ vigbete nkɛ shanɛntɔ, nya-ãsinɛm pɛli vishonɛ a shɔbii ji ɗagbete shɔu a suruni yɛ. <verse eid="ROM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2" />Nya-ãsinɛ gbete Musa mati shɔ u kaka ɔ̃ suwɛrɛ bi ji a ɗagbete si ɓɛɛvɔ doo a suruni yɛ, ama ɓɛɛvɔ kɛ vɔnɛ kɛɗɔn kpaau ɔ̃nɛ yuutɛ a nya-ãsinɛ gbete si mauyɛ a ɓɛɛvɔni. <verse eid="ROM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3" />Arumkɔ kɛ tɛ vɔshɔ wɔɔnɛ ɓɛɛvɔ doo a nɔni, shɔyɛ ɓaunɛ sukpangtang; ama ɓɛɛvɔ kɛ vɔnɛ, nya-ãsinɛ yasiu nyabatɛ gbororo u tɛ vɔshɔ wɔɔrɛ, ji pɛli kpangtang ɓa, naakɛ tɛ vɔshɔ wɔɔnɛyɛ. <verse eid="ROM 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4" />N shɔbiiyi ji nankɔ a ɔkɔɔni, ɔ vɔ sɔ̃ntɛjo a gbete Ɗalapa ɓasɔɔtɛ a Kirisi biini, a nyaba nya-asinɛ Musa, dɔdɔrim ɔ ɔ̃kɛtɛ u ɓɛɛ, kɛ shɔ gbete shɔ yusiu a sàà yɛ, aru u vishonɛ ɔ̃nɛ tɔ̃vɨn u shɛtɔ a Ɗalapa ɗekɨn. <verse eid="ROM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5" />Aɗagbete u a suruni yɛ, nya-ãsinɛ ɗakaɔrɛ u yɛ ɗekɨn a vishonɛ kɔ̃linɛni gbeteu kasiyɛni, u vipɛlinɛ kpai u nyayisinɛ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ vɔnɛ. <verse eid="ROM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6" />Ama dɔdɔrim Ɗalapa yasiu nyabatɛ a nya-ãsinɛ gbete ã Musa yɛni, aru siu vɔtɛttɔ a vigbete mau a jaahmyini, ama dɔdɔrim u bɛli Ɗalapa kɛ a ɔ̃nɛ tete u suru sɔɔ, bɛlinɛ gbaali gbete u pɛli Ɗalapa a nya-ãsinɛ tɛɛtɛ gboti.<verse eid="ROM 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyaãsinɛ a Ruuvini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7" />U yɛ shakɛnɛ nyaãsinɛ Musa kɛ ruuvini ya? Ɓa ruuvini ɓa ko fɛ̃ɛ̃ǃ Ama ji nyaãsinɛkɔ pɔ̃rɛ n zɛ vigbete shɔ ɓaanɛ ruuvinirɛ, nya-ãsinɛ si ji shaɓanɛ,&lt;&lt;Mɔkɔ shoo vigbete shɔwɔɔ ɓɛɛ nɛ,&gt;&gt; N si ji zɛ vigbete shɔ ɓaanɛ vishoonɛ ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8" />Ama a nyabankɔ nya-ãsinɛ yasi ruuvini nyaba u pɛli vigbete u kasi pɛlinɛ yɛ piti kpai, kɛɗɔn ruuvini ji ɔ̃ ɓa si nya ãsinɛ vɔtɛttɔ u kaka ɓa ɗɔn ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9" />Ɗawɔɔ siɗɔn ang ɔ̃nɛ, gbete si n ji zɛ viwɔ ɓa nɛ nya-ãsinɛ Musa ɓa, ama naa nya-ãsinɛ atɛ, kɛɗɔn ruuvini yukɛ a kakani ang ɔ̃nɛni, <verse eid="ROM 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10" />ang vɔrɛ. A nya-ãsinɛm gbete shɔ pɛli aru nɛu ã shɔ suruyɛ, ang bi n ting kɛ vɔnɛ. <verse eid="ROM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11" />Ruuvini shovi a nya ãsinɛ kaka a ɗakinrɛ, a nyɔ vɔrɔrɛ.<verse eid="ROM 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12" />Arumkɔ Musa vimati pɛ vi wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ, a nya-ãsinɛni pɛ vi wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ, pɛ vitɔ̃vɨng. <verse eid="ROM 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13" />Ama ɔ zɛng kɛ naa vi gbete tɔ̃vɨn ukɔ n ting vɔnɛrɛ ya? Ɓa ukɔ ɓa! Pɛ ruuvini ukɔ pɔ̃rɛ n kpaa vɔnɛrɛ, sho vishonɛ a vitɔvɨng, ruuvini n ting vɔnɛrɛ, aru u tadɔɔ nɔgbete jazɛ ruuvini ɔ̃ yɛ, a nyaba nya-ãsinɛnkɔ ruuvini shɛshi bi a ɓili nɔgbete u kɔ̃linɛ tɛɛ kakani.<verse eid="ROM 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bà gbete au ɓuzɨn bi aru u ruuvini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14" />U zɛ tɛttɔ nya-ãsinɛ Musa pɛ vi gbete sã visuru, ama n ɓɛɛ shɔzɛ gbete a kotipi, foo weze a ruuvini naa. <verse eid="ROM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15" />N ji zɛ vi gbete n pɛliyɛ ɓa, aru vi gbete n kasi pɛlinɛyɛ, n pɛli ɓa ukɔ ɓa, ama vi gbete n bẽẽyɛ, n pɛli ji ukɔ. <verse eid="ROM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16" />Asitɛɗɔkɔ vi gbete n pɛliyɛ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ vi gbete n ji kasi pɛlinɛ ɓayɛ, vim tasitɛ nɛ nya -ãsinɛ pɛ vitɔ̃vɨng. <verse eid="ROM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17" />Arumkɔ ɓa nkɔng pɛli vimrɛ ang yuu ɓa, ama pɛ ruuvini gbete au ɔ̃ ang biiyɛ. <verse eid="ROM 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18" />N zɛ tɛttɔ vi wɔɔ tɔ̃vɨn ɓa gbete ɔ̃ ang sisɨnni yɛ ɓa, kɛ ang ɔ̃nɛ jazɛ shɔzɛ kootipi, aruviya n sisɨn aɗɔn n pɛli vi gbete tɔ̃vɨn, ama n zɛnɔɔ pɛlinɛ ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19" />N pɛli ɓa vitɔ̃vɨng gbete n kasi pɛlinɛ ɓa, ama ruuvini gbete n kasi pɛlinɛ ɓa n yɛ ɗekɨn ɓɛɛ ji ukɔ pɛlinɛ. <verse eid="ROM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20" />N kɛ pɛlinɛ vi gbete n ji kasi pɛlinɛ ɓa, vim tasitɛ nɛ ɓa nkɔng pɛli vimrɛ ɓa, ama pɛ ruuvini gbete ɔ̃ ang sisɨn yɛ u pɔ̃rɛ nɛn pɛlirɛ.<verse eid="ROM 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21" />Aru nankɔ n zɛtɛ nya-ãsinɛ Musam pɛ ɗɔ vishonɛ pɛlinɛ, naa nkɛ kasi vi tɔ̃vɨn pɛlinɛ nɛ, kɛɗɔn n zɛ vikɔ̃linɛ ang ɗɔbii ko sheeli. <verse eid="ROM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22" />Ang sisɨn ɓuzɨn n tɛ Ɗalapa nya-ãsinɛ tɛttɔ. <verse eid="ROM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23" />Ama n zɛ sɔ̃n nya-ãsinɛ wɔɔ shovi shonɛrɛ ang bi, kɛ nya-ãsinɛ gbete au waaba a nya-ãsinɛ gbete n sisɨn kasiyɛ. Nya ãsinɛ ruuvini ukɔ pɔ̃ntɛ naa shɔ jahm a ayuu ruuvini gbete ang biiyɛ ni. <verse eid="ROM 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24" />N ɔ̃tɛ viraakɔ sheeliǃ Pi yɛ ranpi a bim gbete kɛ n tinɛ a ɗɔvɔnɛ piya? <verse eid="ROM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25" />N dɔ̃ri Ɗalapa tɛ aru rantɛ a Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi kabii!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 7:25">Aru nankɔ shɔmpɛ vigbete n gelin yuu yɛ: n ang yuu n pɛ foo a Ɗalapa nya-ãsinɛ ang sisɨn, ama ang vishonɛ jazɛ shɔzɛ n bassi ɓɛɛjo nya-ãnɛ ruuvini.<verse eid="ROM 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃nɛ a Suru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1" />Shɔ gbeteyi pɛ kirisi Yesɔ ɓɛɛ yɛ, ruuyeenɛ ayuu vɔnɛ ɓa ai yuuni dɔdɔrim niɓa. <verse eid="ROM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2" />Aru Ɗa suru kaka gbete n-tiu suru kaliu naatɛ aru gbete u ã sisɨn a Kirisi Yesɔ bi, shɔ gbete Ɗalapa lɔɔyɛ u raau shɔbiiyiyɛ. <verse eid="ROM 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3" />Vi gbete nya-ãsinɛ Musa ji zɛnɔɔ pɛlinɛ ɓa, aru shɔzɛ vi pɛlinɛ u kaka ɓa, Ɗalapa pɛlirɛ. Ɗalapa nyɔ ruuvini a shɔzɛ bi, a nyaba gbete sho ɓɛɛ jaayɛ, shɔ gbeteu arɛ a shẽẽbii shɔzɛ gbete ruuvini a ɗɔnni, aru u sɔ̃nriu ruuvini, <verse eid="ROM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4" />Ɗalapa pɛli vim aru vishonɛ vitɔ̃vɨng gbete nya-ãsinɛ kasinɛu pɛliyɛ, u pɛlitɔ u shɔgbete Ɗa suru shovi au biiyɛ, ama ɓa a ɔ̃nɛ tete ruuvini ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5" />Shɔ gbeteyi ɔ̃nɛ pɛ shɔzɛ vi pɛlinɛ, i sisɨn sɔɔ a vi gbete shɔzɛ kasiyɛ. Shɔ gbeteyi ɔ̃nɛ pɛ shɔ Ɗa suru, i sisɨn sɔɔ a vi gbete Ɗa suru kasiyɛ. <verse eid="ROM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6" />Sɔɔrinɛ sisɨn a vi gbete shɔzɛ pɛliyɛ n ti vɔnɛ; ama sɔɔrinɛ sisɨn a Ɗa suru n ti suru a ɔ̃nɛ binyatɔ̃nɛ. <verse eid="ROM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7" />Shɔ gbeteyi sisɨn a vigbete shɔzɛ pɛliyɛ ɔ̃tɛ Ɗalapa shɔnɔpɔ̃, aru i ɡɨn Ɗalapa nya-ãsinɛ ɓa, i zɛnɔɔ gɨnnɛ ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8" />Shɔ gbeteyi gɨn shɔzɛ vipɛlinɛ i pɔ̃ Ɗalapa ɓa u nta sisɨn pururɛ ɓa.<verse eid="ROM 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9" />Ama ɔ ɔ̃nɛ ɓa shɔzɛ zɔng ɔ̃nɛ ɓa, pɛ Ɗa suru ɓɛɛ, naa nizɛ kɔ Ɗa suru kɛ ɔ̃nɛ awɔ sisɨn. kopiya gbeteu Kirisi suru ɓa, u ɓa kirisi ɓɛɛ ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10" />Ama Kirisi kɛ ɔ̃nɛ a ɔkɔni, ko a bi vɔtɛ aru ruuvini, ama Ɗa suru ãwɔ surutɔ aru ɔ ã sisɨntɛ a Ɗabii, Ɗalapa pɔ̃ ɔ̃tɛ ɔ pɛ shɔ tɔ̃vɨn. <verse eid="ROM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11" />Naa Ɗa suru, gbete yusi Yesɔ a sàà u ɗɔ ɔ̃nɛ awɔ sisɨn, kɛɗɔn shɔgbete au yusi Kirisi a sàà yɛ ukɔma yɛ awɔ bi gbete vɔtɛttɔ surutɔ, a nyaba u suru gbete ɔ̃ awɔ sisɨnyɛ.<verse eid="ROM 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12" />Kɛɗɔn mazɔ̃ a manayi, u vipɛlinɛ ɗɔn, ama ɓanɛu gɨn vigbete u bi kasi nɛ u pɛliyɛ nɛu pɛliu ukɔ ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13" />Aru ɔ kɛ ɔ̃nɛ, ɔ̃nɛ shɔzɛ vipɛlinɛ, ɔ yɛ vɔtɔ; ama ɔ kɛ ɔ̃nɛ, ɔnɛ Ɗa suru kaka kɛɗɔn ɔ nyɔ ɔ̃nɛ ruuvinirɛ, ɔ yɛ ɔ̃ a suruni. <verse eid="ROM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14" />Shɔ gbete Ɗa Suru tɛɛsiyi ɗekɨn yɛ i pɛ Ɗalapa jaayi. <verse eid="ROM 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15" />Aru Ɗa Suru gbete Ɗalapa ãwɔ yɛ, ɓa shɔ gbete ɔ yɛ ɔ̃ foo yɛɓa, u pɔ̃ ɔrɛ ɔ ɔ̃ seeti ɓa; ama Suruwu pɔ̃ ɔrɛ ɔ ɔ̃ Ɗa jaayi, a nyaba Ɗa Surukɔ u gaki Ɗa, u shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Abba, Da!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16" />Ɗa Suru ɓasiu yuu au suruni a tasinɛu pɛ Ɗa jaayi. <verse eid="ROM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17" />U kɛ ɔ̃nɛ Ɗa jaayi kɔya, u yɛ kpaa vɔɔ susãri gbete Ɗalapa pɔ̃siu shɔbiiyitɔ, au yɛ kpaa vigbete Ɗalapa pɔ̃si Kirisi yɛtɔ, naa ukɛ ɓooranɛ a Kirisini nyazɔɔ, kɛɗɔn Ɗalapa yɛ ɓassiu jo a ukɔni a nyazɔɔ.<verse eid="ROM 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɓassinɛ gbete a Ɗekɨn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18" />N zɛtɛttɔ raaɓoonɛ gbete ɔkɛ ɓoonɛ dɔdɔrim shɔyɛ tɛsi ɓa a Ɗalapa basinɛ gbete yɛ tasiu a ɗekɨn yɛ ni ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19" />Ɗa vishɛshinɛyi kpai i zassi bitɛ fɛ̃ɛm, i ɗɔgbete i gaa yɛ, nɛ Ɗalapa tasi shɔgbete i pɛ ɓɛjaayi yɛ pɛ. <verse eid="ROM 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20" />A Ɗalapa pɔ̃ vi gbete shɛshi yɛ kpai i yaa ruu vi gbete shɛshiyi ai yuunitɛ, ɓai kasinɛ ɓa ama pɛ vi gbete Ɗalapa kasiyɛ, a shɔmni kpai sisɨn pɔ̃nɛ siɗɔn. <verse eid="ROM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21" />Nɛ vigbete Ɗa shɛshiyɛ i ai yuu i ranɛ a bassinɛ gbeteyi pɛli vi pmnɛyɛ, a nɛi kpaa bassinɛni gbete shɔ yɛ pɛli Ɗa jaayi yɛ. <verse eid="ROM 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22" />U zɛ tɛttɔ anɛ dɔdɔrim vigbete Ɗa shɛshi kpai i ɗɔ gbeteyi nta kɔnɛ naa su gbete nta kɔnɛ a ɗɔ jaa yeenɛ. <verse eid="ROM 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23" />Ama ɓa vigbete Ɗa shɛshikɔ sheeli i nta kɔnɛrɛ ɓa; u shɔ gbete u kpaa Ɗa Surutɛ gbete ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ vi gbete Ɗalapa gau ãnɛyɛ, u ɗɔgbete u nta kɔnɛ au sisɨn, u ɗɔ ganɛ fɛ̃ɛm aru Ɗalapa u risiukɛ u ɓɛɛ jaayi, u rau yuu tɔ. <verse eid="ROM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24" />Ji a nyaba sisɨn pɔ̃nɛkɔ Ɗalapa raurɛ; ama ukɛ zɛ vigbete u pɔ̃ sisɨn au yuuninɛ gboti, shom toti sisɨn pɔ̃nɛ ɓa. Pi awɔ tetteni pɔ̃ sisɨn a vigbete kpaa tɛttɔ piya? <verse eid="ROM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25" />Ama ukɛ pɔ̃ sisɨn nɛ a vigbete u ji zɛ ɓayɛ, u gatɔ a sisɨn zaza.<verse eid="ROM 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26" />Ji nankɔ Ɗa Suru arɛ u pɔ̃siunaa, u kaka ji yɛ ɓa, aru u ji zɛ nɔgbete u gaki Ɗa ɓa; ama Ɗa Suru au yuu gakiu Ɗalapa tɔ aru vigbete u nya zɛnɔɔ shanɛ dɔɔɓa. <verse eid="ROM 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27" />Ɗalapa shɔ gbete zɛu sisɨn tɛttɔ, zɛ vi gbete Ɗa Suru ã sisɨn tɛttɔ; aru Ɗa Suru gaki Ɗalapa tɔ ayuu u shɔbiiyini, ji naa gbete Ɗalapa sisɨn kasiyɛ.<verse eid="ROM 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28" />U zɛ tɛttɔ vi kpai Ɗalapa pɛli vishonɛ tɔ̃vɨn shɔ gbeteyi ɔriiyitɔ, shɔgbete ɓai nya aru vigbete kasi pɛlinɛyɛ. <verse eid="ROM 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29" />Shɔgbete Ɗalapa lɔyi tɛttɔ gboti, pɛliyi tɛttɔ i ɔ̃ naa ɓɛjaa shɛ̃ɛ̃bii, nɔgbete ɓɛjaa u ɔ̃ jamari a ɓuzɨn shɔ gbeteyi ã sisɨn Ɗa bi. <verse eid="ROM 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30" />Shɔgbete Ɗalapa lɔyi tɛttɔ ɓaanya ji ikɔ, a shɔgbete Ɗalapa ɓai nyayɛ, pɔ̃ ikɔyi i ruuvini ɓa au ɗekɨn ni ɓa, Ɗalapa ɓasijo ikɔ.<verse eid="ROM 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɗalapa ɔrinɛ a Kirisi Yesɔ bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31" />A bilinɛ vim, u yɛ sha kɛnɛ iviya? Ɗalapa kɛ ɔ̃nɛ a ukɔni pi yɛ masinya pi ukɔni piya? <verse eid="ROM 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32" />Ɗalapa ji zãriu u jaa ɓa, ama ã ɓɛjaa a shɔ gbeteyi nyɔyɛ naa aru ukɔ kpai! Ãu ɓɛjaatɛ yɛ zɛnɔɔ ɓa u ãu vi gãsiyi weze kpai nagbete ãu ɓɛjaa ɓaya? <verse eid="ROM 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33" />Pi yɛ wuli shɔgbete Ɗalapa lɔyiyɛ piya? Ji Ɗalapa au yuu sharɛ nɛi ruuvini ɓa au kabii ni ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34" />Pi yɛ yeruu vɔnɛ ai yuuni kɛpiya? Kirisi Yesɔ shɔ gbete vɔyɛ, ko shɔu shanɛ shɔ gbete au yurɛ a sàà a suruni, au ɗɔ ɔ̃nɛ a Ɗalapa nakɨn, ukɔ u a ɗɔ Ɗa gakinɛ au yuu! <verse eid="ROM 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35" />Pi yɛ vɔsiu kɛpi a ɔrinɛ gbete Kirisi pɛliuyɛ piya? Kɛ raɓoonɛ ya ko bintanɛ ya, ko ratasinɛ, ko nwo ya, ko raa, yaa, ko viyaa ya, ko vɔrɔ ya? <verse eid="ROM 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36" />Ji nagbete Ɗanyarubii shayɛ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:36">&lt;&lt;Aru mɔkɔ u pɔ̃ vɔrɔtɛ a ɗekɨn ko ɗaaviya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 8:36">shɔ tuutɛ naa mɛrɛ̃ gbete shɔ yɛkɛ ɗɔ yeenɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37" />A ɓuzɨn vim kpai Ɗashariu tɛttɔ kpai, shɔm a shɔgbete ɔriu yɛ kabii! <verse eid="ROM 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38" />N zɛ tɛttɔ viwɔɔ yɛ vɔsiu ɓa au ɔrinɛni ɓa, ko vɔrɔ, ko suru, ko Ɗajashonɛlapayi, ko kpatiyi tot-tot i kaka, ko shɔ dɔdɔrim ko shɔ ɗekɨn. <verse eid="ROM 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39" />Ko koo gbete a lapa ko koo gbete a tipi, atette vigbete Ɗalapa shɛshi yɛ kpai, viwɔɔ yɛ zɛnɔɔ ɓa u vɔsiurɛ a ɔrinɛ gbete Ɗalapa pɛliu a ka Kirisi Yesɔ Uɓeyelapani ɓa.<verse eid="ROM 8:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9" />
  <para style="s1">Ɗalapa Au Shɔbiiyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1" />Ruu tɔ̃vɨn gbete n sham, aru n pɛ Kirisi ɓɛɛ; n yeeɓa nyaɓa. N sisɨn tasin tɛttɔ a Ɗa Suru kabii, n yeeɓa nyaɓa <verse eid="ROM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2" />n sisɨn hɨmtɛ fɛ̃ɛm, ang sisɨn kɔntɔ ko-piɗaviya <verse eid="ROM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3" />Shɔ si tɔnɛ n ang yuu shɔ wirintɛ a Ɗalapa ɗekɨn, shɔu kɔn nɔkɨntɔ a Kirisi bi aru n shɔbiiyi raanɛ, kɛ n nyakooyi . <verse eid="ROM 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4" />Ikɔi ɔ̃rɛ shɔ Israilayi, vi ɓasiyi tɛttɔ a Ɗalapani, Ɗalapa tɛyi tɛttɔ pɛ ɓɛɛ jaayi, i kpaa Ɗalapa bassinɛ tɛttɔ; Ɗa maruu tɛttɔ ayini, ãyi nya-ãsinɛ tɛttɔ; i bassinɛ tɔ̃vɨn aɗɔn, i tɛ ruu gbete Ɗalapa ma tɛttɔ; <verse eid="ROM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5" />ikɔma i shɛpɛ ji au ɓɛuru- ɓɛuru gbete shɔ zɛyi tɛttɔ tɛ̃ɛ̃tɛ̃ɛ̃kɔ; Kirisi u ɔ̃nɛ shɔzɛ shɛ ji Helena ladurukɔ. mɛnɛ Ɗalapa au roo kpati a koo piti bɛlinɛ u ɔ̃ u ɓɛɛkɔ dangdang! Nankɔ.<verse eid="ROM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6" />Ama ɓanɛ n shanɛ nɛ Ɗanyaruubii yɛ pɛli dɔɔɓa ɓa, aruviya ɓa shɔ Israilayi kpai i shɔ gbeteyi ã sisɨn a Ɗa bi ɓa <verse eid="ROM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7" />Sɔ̃n ɓanɛ Ibirayi ɓɛuruyi kpai i Ɗa jaayi ɓa. Ɗalapa geli Ibirayi nɛ, &lt;&lt;A Ishaku kɔ kabiikɔ a yɛ kpaa mɛuruyirɛ shɔ gbete n ma mɔkɔniyɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8" />Vim tasitɛ nɛ, jaayi gbete shɔ yeerɛ a nyaba gbete shɔzɛ yeeyɛ i ɓa Ɗa jaayi ɓa; ama see jaayi gbete shɔ yee a nyaba Ɗalapa ruumanɛ, ikɔi ɔ̃rɛ jawuru tɔ̃vɨn. <verse eid="ROM 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9" />Ɗalapa ruumanɛ a Ibirayini ɔ̃rɛ nɛ, &lt;&lt;Saa wɔɔ ɗaa nankɔ n yɛn sɔɔtɔ, Saratu yɛ yee jaavɔshɔtɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10" />Vi tasinɛ wɔsɔ̃n aɗɔn, Rabeka jaa zitiyi i ɓeye gbete, ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ u ɓɛuru Ishayaku. <verse eid="ROM 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11" />Ama Ɗalapa a naa kawɔ ji lɔ jaamiyi ɓa aru viwɔ ɓa, aru u yisinya vitɔ̃vɨng gbete shayɛ u ɔ̃ nizɛ, Ɗalapa geli Rabeka nɛ&lt;&lt;Shɔ pɛ̃niba yɛ ɔ̃ shɔ wujau u foo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12" />Ɗalapa sha vim si shɔ ji yee ɓa. i ji pɛli viwɔɔ ɓa kɔ̃linɛ ko tɔ̃vɨn ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13" />Ji nagbete Ɗanyarubii shayɛ nɛ,&lt;&lt;N ɔri Yakubtɛ ama n bɛ̃ɛ̃ Isuwa tɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14" />U yɛ shakɛnɛ Ɗalapa ji pɛli ɓa tɔ̃vɨn ɓaya? ko pɛ̃tɛ̃rɛ̃ ɓa nankɔ ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15" />Ɗalapa geli Musa nɛ,&lt;&lt;Shɔ gbete n kasiyɛ n ntau raatɔ kopiya; shɔgbete yasi shɔ ruuvinitɔ kopiya n yasiu ruuvini sɔ̃njo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16" />Aru nankɔ ɓanɛ vi gbete shɔzɛ kasiyɛ Ɗalapa pɛli vi aru ukɔ ɓa, ama see nɔgbete Ɗalapa nta shɔ raa sheeli <verse eid="ROM 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17" />Ɗanyaruubii geli kpati Masar nɛ,&lt;&lt;N pɔ̃rɛ a ɔ̃ kpati aru n sho vishonɛ a mɔkɔni n tasin kaka a kootipi kpai, wɔsɔ̃n shɔu ɓan nii a kootipi kpai.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18" />Aru nankɔ Ɗalapa nta raa shɔ gbete lɔyi nɛn ntayi raayɛ, a shɔ gbete Ɗalapa kasiu sisɨn lakinɛ yɛ laki sisɨn ji ukɔ,<verse eid="ROM 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɗalapa Sisɨn Lɛsinɛ A Raa Ntanɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19" />Ama shɔzɛ gbete awɔ tete yɛ gelin nɛ,&lt;&lt;Vim kɛ ɔ̃nɛ nankɔ, Kɛ aruvi Ɗalapa doo a ɗɔɔ zɛnɛ nɛu shɔruuvini anɛ dɔdɔrim viya? Pi yɛ bɛ̃ɛ̃ vi gbete Ɗalapa kasiyɛ kɛpiya? <verse eid="ROM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20" />Ama mɔkɔ ɔ̃rɛ piya shɔzɛ, gbete a yɛ masinya a Ɗalapani piya? Tɔ̃pɔ̃ ɓari maanɛ hɨ shɔ gbete maauyɛ viwɔɔ dɔɔɓa nɛ, a mang aru ivi nankɔ viya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21" />Akɨntini kpai, shɔgbete maa ɓari tɔ̃pɔ̃ yɛ, u kaka aɗɔn u pɛli vi gbete kasi pɛlinɛ a tɔ̃pɔ̃ni, a yɛ zɛnɔɔtɔ a tuu mutinɛ tɔ̃pɔ̃ gbete a maa ɓari ziti awuni, gbete u ɔ̃ shɔ gbete shɔ pɛli vishonɛ awuni a lee pɛ̃niba, a wɔɔ gbete shɔ pɛli vishonɛ awuni a lee weze.<verse eid="ROM 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22" />Ɗalapa vishonɛ ji nankɔ. Ɗalapa kasiu sisɨn lɛsinɛ tasinɛtɔ, u tasiu nɔgbete u kaka ɔ̃yɛ shɔu zɛtɔ. Ama au ɓuzɨn u nyamɛrɛ masisɨntɔ fɛ̃ɛm a shɔ gbeteyi lɛsiu sisɨnni, shɔ gbete Ɗalapa lɔyi a ɓuzɨn lɛsinɛ. <verse eid="ROM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23" />Ɗalapa kasinɛn ɓeli u bassinɛ pɛ̃niba gbete tasi shɔ gbete nta raayɛ, shɔ gbete si matɛttɔ a gaanɛ aru bassinɛ. <verse eid="ROM 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24" />Kɛ ukɔu ɔ̃rɛ shɔ gbete Ɗalapa ɓai nyayɛ, ɓa a ɓuzɨn Yahudawayi kɔ sheeli ɓa ama piti a shɔ gbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓani kpai <verse eid="ROM 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25" />Shɔmpɛ vigbete sha a labeenɛ Hosiya nɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">&lt;&lt;Shɔ gbeteyi i ɓa nɓɛɛ ɓa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">N yɛn ɓai nya&lt;i ɔ̃ nɓɛɛ.&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">Shɔ gbeteyi n ji ɔri ɓa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">N yɛn ɓai nɛ, &lt;N shɔ ɔrinɛ.&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26" />Toti, a ɗɔgbete shɔ geliyɛ nɛ&lt;Ɔ ɓa nɓɛɛ shɔzɛ ɓa,&gt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:26">A ɗɔukɔ shɔ yɛ ɓainɛ Ɗa gbete u a suruni jaayi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27" />Shompɛ vigbete Ishaya sha a shɔ Isreilayi yuu yɛ nɛ:&lt;&lt;Ko shɔ Israila i ɔ̃ waanɛ naa seseli a nya wapo, a shɔmni kpai shɔ yɛ raa shɔzɛ fɛ̃ɛ̃ atete ni; <verse eid="ROM 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28" />Aru Uɓeyelapa yɛ pɛli vigbete tonɛn pɛliyɛtɔ a koo kpai tɛ̃ɛ̃ti.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29" />Ji na gbete Ishaya si yɛ nɛ,&lt;&lt; Uɓeyelapa shɔ gbete vitɛu kaka ɓa si ji yasiu laduru ɓa, u si riitɛ naa Sɔdom, u si riitɛ naa Gomora.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Israila a ruu tɔ̃vɨn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30" />Ji nankɔ u shanɛ shɔgbete i ɓa Yahudawa ɓa, ai ji kã ɔ̃nɛ tɔ̃vɨn ɓa a Ɗalapa ɗɔbiini ɓa, ama dɔdɔrim i kpaatɛ a nyaba sisɨn ãnɛ. <verse eid="ROM 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31" />Naa Ɗalapa shɔbiiyi, gbete i kã Musa nya ãsinɛ gbete yɛ pɔ̃i a Ɗalapa ɗekɨn, i ji kpaa ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32" />Ivi sɨnrɛ nankɔ viya? Aru i ji pɔ̃ sisɨn ɓa a sisɨn ãnɛni ɓa ama i pɔ̃ sisɨn a vigbeteyi i pɛliyɛ. Kɛɗɔn i kɔ dɔɔ rɛ a &lt;&lt;Tari dɔɔ kɔnɛni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33" />Ji na gbete Ɗanyaruubii shayɛ nɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">&lt;&lt; Kɨnnɔɔ pɛ n a ɗɔ tari pɔ̃nɛ a Sihiyona</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">gbete yɛ pɔ̃rɛ shɔu kɔdɔɔ aɗɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">tari gbete yɛ pɔ̃yirɛ i nwesirɛ. Ama shɔ gbete kɛ ã sisɨn nɛ au bi yɛ nta yusẽ ɓa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1" />Mazɔ̃yi, nɔgbete n kasi ang sisɨn yɛ piti kpai n gaki n shɔ biyi Ɗa i kpaa raanɛtɔ! Nɔgbete n Ɗalapa ai yuu yɛ! <verse eid="ROM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2" />N shi tɛttɔ ai kɨnti ni i sisɨn Ɗalapa bɛlinɛ aɗɔn; ama sisɨn ãnɛ ɓa aru vi zɛnɛ tɔ̃vɨn ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3" />I ji zɛ nyaba gbete Ɗalapa pɔ̃rɛ shɔu ɔ̃rɛ tɔ̃vɨn a ukɔni ɓa, kɛɗɔn i kã kɛji i nyaba yuu aru i ɔ̃ shɔ tɔ̃vɨn a Ɗalapa ɗekɨn, ama shɔm kɔ pɔ̃rɛ i ji ã yuu ɓa aru i ɔ̃ shɔ tɔ̃vɨn a Ɗalapa ɗekɨn ni ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4" />Aru Kirisri kɔ shiri vishonɛ pɛlinɛrɛ a nya-ãsinɛni, nɔgbete kopiya kɛ ã sisɨn nɛ aɗɔn u kpaa ɔ̃nɛ tɔ̃vɨn a Ɗalapa ɗekɨn.<verse eid="ROM 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Raanɛ pɛ Kopiya Ɓɛɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5" />Musa bee tɛttɔ nɔgbete shɔ kpaa ɔ̃nɛ tɔ̃vɨn a nyaba nya-āsinɛ gɨnnɛː&lt;&lt; Shɔu kɛ gɨn ruu nya-ãsinɛyi nɛ yɛ ɔ̃tɔ a suruni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6" />Ama vi gbete Ɗanyaruubii shayɛ ayuu ɔ̃nɛ tɔ̃vɨn a Ɗalapa ɗekɨn a nyaba sisɨn ãnɛ ukɔ ɔrɛ:&lt;&lt;Mɔkɔ hɨ a yuu nɛ, nɛ pi yɛ, yɛ kolapa piya?&gt;&gt;( Kɛ aru, u n ti Kirisi tipi). <verse eid="ROM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7" />&lt;&lt;Ko mɔkɔ hɨ a yuu nɛ, pi yɛ nɔ kotipi dii pi&gt;&gt; (Kɛ aru u yusi Kirisi a sàà). <verse eid="ROM 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8" />Vigbete Ɗanyaruubii shaye ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ:&lt;&lt;Ɗanyaruubii ji awɔ ɗɔbii ɗɔɔli, awɔ nya wɔsɔ̃n awɔ sisɨn&gt;&gt;Kɛ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ ruu sisɨn ãnɛ gbete ɔ nwayɛ. <verse eid="ROM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9" />Akɛ shanɛ a nya nɛ, Yesɔ kɔ ɔ̃rɛ Uɓeyelapa aa ã sisɨn nɛ Ɗalapa yusiutɛ a sàà, Ɗalapa yɛ raatɔ. <verse eid="ROM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10" />Ji aru sisɨn ãnɛ kɔ u ɔ̃kɛkɨn tɔ̃vɨn a Ɗalapa ɗekɨn ni; ji a nyakɔ shɔ gbete kɛ geli shɔwɔ nɛ nɛn gɨn Yesɔ tɛ Ɗalapa yɛ rautɔ. <verse eid="ROM 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11" />Ɗanyaruubii shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Kopiya gbete kɛ ã sisɨn nɛ au biini shɔ yɛ ãwu yusẽɓa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12" />Shɔm sã kopiya, aruiviya ko Yahudawayi ko shɔ gbete ɓa Yahudawayi ɓa i vɔsinɛ ɓa a ɗɔmɓa; Ɗalapam gbete ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ kopiya Uɓeyelapa, ukɔ tasi shɔ vɔɔ susãrirɛ a bi kpai shɔ gbete kɛ ɓaa nyanɛ au ɗɔbii. <verse eid="ROM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13" />Ji nagbete Ɗanyaruubii shayɛ nɛ,&lt;&lt; Kopiya kɛ ɓaa nyanɛ a Uɓeyelapa nii aru napɔ̃sinɛ, Ɗalapa yɛ rautɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14" />Ama i kɛ tɔnɛu pɔ̃siyinaa i yɛ ɓau nya kɛpikovi i ji ã sisɨn ɓau biini ɓa viya? A i yɛ ã sisɨn kɛpikovi i ji nta ruu ɓa viya? Toti i yɛ nta kɛpikovi naa shɔ ji nwariyi ruu ɓa viya? <verse eid="ROM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15" />Shɔ yɛ nwa ruu kɛpikovi naa shɔ ji sho Jashonɛyi ɓa viya? Ji nagbete Ɗanyaruubii shayɛ nɛ,&lt;&lt;Yɛ ɔ̃ vibiizaanɛ pikoviya jashonɛyi kaanɛ shɔ gbeteyi i n ti ruu tɔ̃vɨn yɛ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16" />Ama ɓa shɔzɛ pitiyi i tɛ ruu tɔ̃vɨnyi rɛ ɓa. Ishaya ayuu shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Uɓeyelapa, pi a sisɨn au ruuni piya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17" />Aru nankɔ shɔ nta ji ruukɔ shɔ a sisɨn kn, shɔ nta ruu sɔ̃n ji ayuu nyanwanɛ Kirisikɔ.<verse eid="ROM 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18" />Ama n hɨ pɛ: I ji nta ruu ɓa nizɛ ya? I nta tɛttɔ, Aru Ɗanyaruubii shanɛ:&lt;&lt;I yeenya yɛ tɛttɔ a kootipi kpai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:18">I ruu to ɗɔ gbete kootipi doonya tɛttɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19" />Toti n hɨ pɛ: nɛ shɔ Israilayi i ji zɛ ɓa ya? Musa au yuu kasinya nɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">&lt;&lt; N yɛn pɛli vishonɛ kn shɔzɛ gbete i ɓa shɔzɛ ɓa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:19">n pɔ̃rɛ n shɔbiiyi kaagɨn;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">a n yɛn shɔvi a shɔ gbeteyi i rãngyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:19">n pɔ̃ n shɔbiiyi i sisɨn u lɛsirɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20" />A Ishaya yɔriyuutɔ tɔnɛ Ɗalapa shanɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:20">&lt;&lt;Shɔgbete i kpanrɛ pɛ shɔgbeteyi i ji kãn ɗɔɓayɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:20">N shɛ a shɔ gbeteyi i ji kãn ɗɔɓayɛ bi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21" />Ama aru Israila a shailinɛ,&lt;&lt;A ko-pi lee piya kpai n ɓaa nyaa shɔgbeteyi i masinya a nkɔni i weshoo ɓa ang nyani ɓa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11" />
  <para style="s">Ɗalapa Nta Shɔ Israila I Raa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1" />N hɨ pɛ, Ɗalapa ɓɛ̃ɛ̃ u shɔbiiyi tɛttɔ ya? Ji ɓɛ̃ɛ̃yi ɓa! N ang yuu n pɛ shɔ Israila, a Ibirayi laduru, toti n a Benjame ni u nyakoo gbete. <verse eid="ROM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2" />Ɗalapa ji ɓɛ̃ɛ̃ u shɔbiiyi ɓa, shɔ gbete lɔyirɛ a gaanɛ, A ji zɛ gbete Ɗanyaruubii shaliyɛ ɓaya aru Iliya, nɔgbete Iliya sɨnri Ɗalapa nyavɔ aru Israila nɛ: <verse eid="ROM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3" />&lt;&lt;Uɓeyelapa i nyɔki a jashonɛtɛ, a i zɨnli a lazããtɛ a tipi; yaatɛ nkɔng sheeli, toti i ɗɔgbete i kã n ɗɔ nyɔnɛrɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4" />Ama Ɗalapa kasiunya kɛnɛ iviya? kasiunɛ&lt;&lt;N pɔ̃ vɔshɔyi tɛttɔ laa ziti atu kopi ɓa maanzii. (7,000.) shɔgbete i ji ɓassi ɗalapa Baal ɓa yɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5" />Dɔdɔrim ɔ̃tɛ ji nankɔ: yaatɛ shɔzɛ fɛ̃ɛ̃ gbete Ɗalapa lɔyirɛ aru u ɔ̃nɛ tɔ̃vɨn. <verse eid="ROM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6" />Ɗalapa lɔyirɛ pɛ aru u ɔ̃nɛ tɔ̃vɨn, ɓanɛ aru i vishonɛ ɓa. Si tɔnɛn ɔ̃ aru shɔzɛ vishonɛ, kɛɗɔn u ɔ̃nɛ tɔ̃vɨn si ji ɔ̃ ɓa ɔ̃nɛ tɔ̃vɨn nizɛ ɓa.<verse eid="ROM 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7" />Aru nankɔ shɔ Israilayi i ji kpaa vigbete i ɗɔ kãnɛ ɓa. Ama shɔzɛ fɛ̃ɛ̃ gbete Ɗalapa lɔyirɛ ikɔyi kpaarɛ; gãsiyi i ɔ̃kɛ yuukasi. <verse eid="ROM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8" />Ji nagbete Ɗanyaruubii shalinɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɗalapa pɔ̃yi sisɨnrɛ nɛu ɔ̃ nɔti; Anɛ dɔdɔrim Ɗalapa pɔ̃rɛ i nɔɔ zɛ ɓa ko i ntarɛ ɓa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9" />A Dauda shanɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">&lt;&lt;Mɛnɛ i yumusinɛ u ɔ̃riyikɔɔ tari ɗanɛ, vigbete yɛ n-tiyi vɔrɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:9">mɛnɛ i nwesikɔɔtɔ, u ɔ̃rikɛ viruuyeenɛ ayi yuuǃ<verse eid="ROM 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10" />Mɛnɛ i nɔɔ u ɓarikɔɔtɔ nɔgbete i zɛɗɔɓa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:10">mɛnɛ i raɓoonɛ u pɔ̃rɛ ɗarɛ kopiɗaviya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11" />Toti n hɨ pɛ, Naa shɔ Yahudawayi i kɛ nwesinɛ, i nwesitɛ i yɛ yuu toti ɓaya? ɓa nankɔ ɓa! Ji aru i ruuvinikɔ Ɗalapa raa shɔ gbete i ɓa Yahudawayi ɓa rɛ, aru pɔ̃ Yahudawayi i kaagɨnrɛ. <verse eid="ROM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12" />Ama Yahudawayi i ruuvini n ti Ɗa vɔɔ susãri tasinɛ waanɛ a bi a kootipi, a i nwesinɛ suru n ti shɔ gbeteyi i ɓa Yahudawa ɓa Ɗa vɔɔ susãri tasinɛ a bi, Naa Yahudawayi i kɛ ɔ̃nɛ kpai Ɗa vɔɔ susãri tasinɛyi yɛ ɔ̃ kɛpi koviya?<verse eid="ROM 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shɔgbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa i raanɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13" />Dɔdɔrim n nwanya a ɔkɔɔ shɔgbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓaː nagbete nyɛ yɛ ang ɔ̃nɛni n ɔ̃ shɔgbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa jashonɛ, n yɛn ɓasipɛrɛtɔ ang vishonɛni. <verse eid="ROM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14" />Wɔɔɓa n yɛn pɔ̃rɛ n shɔbii shɔ Israila sisɨn u kɔitɔ, nɔgbete n yɛn zɛnɔɔ n raa gãsiyirɛ. <verse eid="ROM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15" />Aru naa shɔ kɛ bɛ̃ɛ̃ Yahudawayi nɛ, kɛɗɔn shɔ gãsiyi kɔsirɛ atette Ɗalapa shɔnɔpɔ̃yi anɛ u ɓɛsayi, ivi yɛ pɛli viya naa i kɛ tɛ ruu tɔ̃vɨn nɛ yɛ?, Ɗalapa yɛ ãyi suru gbete sɔ̃nyaɓayɛ aru nɔgbeteyi si vɔyɛǃ<verse eid="ROM 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16" />Shɔu tɔpɛnɛ shɔ wɔɔ ã Ɗalapa visha au ɓuzɨn visha gbete gaa yeenɛyɛ, kɛɗɔn visha gãsiyi kpai au yeeyɛ ɔ̃ sɔ̃n Ɗalapa ɓɛɛ, naa shɔ Kɛ ã Ɗalapa gɨnri laanɛ, lawu piti kpai ãkɛ Ɗalapa ɓɛɛ. <verse eid="ROM 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17" />gãsi nalaayi zeetung gbete shɔ latɔ shɔ kolirɛ, a shɔ tuu nalaa zeetung shɔ ɓili shɔ dɔsirɛ aɗɔn. Ɔ shɔ gbete ɔ ɓa Yahudawa ɓam, ɔ pɛ naa laa zeetung shɔ ɓili, &lt;&lt;ama dɔdɔrim shɔgbete ɔ ɓa yɛ Yahudawa yɛ kpaa ɔ̃nɛ vɔ susãri tasinɛ jo awɔ kabiikɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18" />Ɔkɔɔ waanaanɛ a nɔsisɨn nɛi tɛɛ nalaayi gbete shɔ kolirɛwatɛ, ɔ bassi yuu kɛpi koviya? Ɔ ɓɛɛjo nalaa weze sheeli; ɓa ɔkɔɔ pɔ̃si gɨnri laayi naarɛ ɓa ama gɨnri laayikɔ i pɔ̃sɔɔ naarɛ.<verse eid="ROM 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19" />Ama ɔ yɛ shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Nn, shɔ koli nalaayi aru shɔu dɔsin wɔyi aɗɔn.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20" />Shompɛ nizɛ. I sisɨn ãnɛ ɓa Yesɔ biini ɓa aruukɔ Ɗalapa koliyirɛ, ama aru ɔ sisɨn ãnɛ aɗɔn ɔ kpaa ɔ̃nɛrɛ a ɗɔuni. Ama ɔkɔɔ waanaanɛ a sisɨnni; nɔgbete ɔ si pɛli nankɔ, a nta seeti <verse eid="ROM 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21" />Ɗalapa ji yaa Yahudawayi ɓa gbeteyi naa gɨn-gɨn nalaayi i yɛ weze, aa zɛnɛ yai nɛ ya weze ya? <verse eid="ROM 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22" />Yɛm u zɛ Ɗalapa vitɔ̃vɨng shonɛtɛ a lewɔɔ sɔ̃n nta shɔ raa ɓa. Shɔgbeteyi nwesitɛ tasiyi raa ntanɛ ɓa, ama tasaa vitɔ̃vɨng shonɛtɔ naa akɛ yɛ ɗeknnɛ a vitɔvɨng shonɛni. Ama a ji yɛ ɗekɨn ɓa a nankɔ ni ɓa, mɔkɔ shɔ yɛ ko atɔ a gɨnrini. <verse eid="ROM 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23" />Ama naa Yahudawayi i ji ɔ̃ ɓa a ɓuzɨn yaanɛ sisɨn ãnɛ Ɗa biini ɓa, Ɗalapa yɛ sɔritɔ au ɗɔbiini; aru Ɗalapa u kaka pɛlinɛ aɗɔn. <verse eid="ROM 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24" />Ɔ shɔ gbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa ɔ naa naarɛ laa zeetung shɔ ɓili gbete shɔ kotɔyɛ, gbete ɓa dɔkɔ ɓa yɛ, kɛɗɔn a shɔ dɔsirɛ a laa zeetung gbete shɔ layɛ. Yahudawayi i naa laa gbete shɔ latɔnkɔ; yɛ ɔ pɛlaa weze Ɗalapau dɔsi nalaa kolinɛyirɛ a laa gbete i si ɗɔnyɛni.<verse eid="ROM 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɗalapa shɔ raanɛ a koo piti kpai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25" />Ruuɓusinɛ aɗɔn, n masayi, gbete n kasirɛ ɔ zɛtɔ, aru yɛ pɔ̃sɔɔnaatɔ ɔ pɔ̃ ɓa sisɨnni nɛi ɔ shɔ sẽrẽe ɓa. Israilayi i yulakinɛ ɓa dangdang ɓa, ama yɛ ɔ̃ri seetɛ shɔ gbeteyi ɓa Yahudawayi ɓa i a Ɗalapa ɗɔbiitɛ kpai. <verse eid="ROM 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26" />A nyabangkɔ Israila i kpai ranaarɛ. Naa Ɗa nyaruubii shayɛ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:26">&lt;&lt;Shɔshɔraanɛ a a Sihiyona.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:26">yɛ pɔ̃ Yakub laduruyi kpai i yaa vigbete bassi Ɗalapa ɓa pɛlinɛ.<verse eid="ROM 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27" />N yɛn maruumkɔ ayini</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:27">naa n kɛ tuuyi ruuvininɛyɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28" />Aru i ɓɛ̃ɛ̃ ruu tɔ̃vɨntɛ, Yahudawayi ɔ̃tɛ Ɗalapa shɔnɔpɔ̃yi, vim ɔ̃tɛ tɔ̃vɨn awɔ ruubii shɔgbete i ɓ yahudawa ɓa miyi. Ama aru Ɗalapa lɔɔyirɛ, i pɛ shɔzɛ gbete Ɗalapa ɔriyɛ aru ɓɛuru ɓɛuruyi. <verse eid="ROM 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29" />Ɗalapa ji kɔsiu sisɨn ɓa ayuu shɔgbete lɔɔyirɛ au tasiyi vɔɔ susari abiini ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30" />A knti ɔ shɔ gbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa ɔ si gɨn Ɗalapa nya ɓa; ama dɔdɔrim ɔ kpaa raa ntanɛtɛ aru Yahudawayi i gɨn Ɗalapa nyaɓayɛ. <verse eid="ROM 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31" />Ji nankɔ, aru raantanɛ gbete ɔ kpaayɛ, Yahudawayi i ɔ̃tɛ shɔ gbeteyi gɨn Ɗalapa nyaɓayɛ dɔdɔrim, shom aru raa ntanɛ gbete shɔ tasɔɔ ikɔma i kpaa Ɗalapa raa ntanɛjo. <verse eid="ROM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32" />Aru Ɗalapa pɔ̃ kopiyatɛ a jaahm shɔgbeteyi gɨu nya ɓa, aru u ntayiraa piti kpai.<verse eid="ROM 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bɛlinɛ a Ɗalapa Bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33" />Ɗalapa vitɔ̃vɨng pɛ̃niba pikoviya! U vizɛnɛ a sẽrẽe pikoya! piyɛ tadɔɔ nɔgbete maruuwu yɛ piya? Piyɛ zɛu nyaba ruuwu piya? <verse eid="ROM 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34" />Nagbete Ɗanyaruubii shayɛnɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:34">&lt;&lt;Pi zɛ Uɓeyelapa sisɨn piya?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:34">Pi zɛnɔɔ Ɗalapa ruu gelinɛ piya?<verse eid="ROM 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35" />Pi ã Ɗalapa vi pi legbete piya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:35">a shɔ tɔnɛ Ɗalapa yɛ sɔɔriu yɛ piya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36" />Aru vi kpai ukɔ shɛshirɛ, toti vi kpai i ɔ̃ ji au kabiikɔ u ɓɛɛkɔ. Bassinɛ u ɔ̃ pɛ Ɗalapa bi dangdangǃ Nankɔ.<verse eid="ROM 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃nɛ a suru a Ɗalapa vishonɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1" />Kɛɗɔn masayi aru Ɗalapa shɔ raantanɛ pɛ̃niba n gaki ɔtɔ ɔ ã yuutɔ: ɔ ɔ̃ a suru ni wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ gbete Ɗa yɛ tɛɔ yɛ, aru shɔmkɔ ɔ̃rɛ Ɗalapa shɔ vɔ susari tasinɛ nizɛ. <verse eid="ROM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2" />Ɔkɔ ɓusi jakɨntimiyi vitɔ̃vɨng gelinɛ nɛ, ɔ yaa ɔ ruuvini pɛlinɛtɔ, ɔ kɔsi sisɨntɔ awɔ nyaba ɔ̃nɛ piti kpai, nɔgbete ɔyɛ zɛ vigbete Ɗalapa kasi nɛɔ pɛliyɛ, ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ vigbete tɔ̃vɨn a nyaba gbete Ɗalapa kasiyɛ piti kpai.<verse eid="ROM 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3" />Aru vitɔ̃vɨng gbete Ɗalapa pɛliyɛː N nwarɔɔ nya jo au yuukɔ nɛ ɔkɔ tun yuu nɛ u tɛɛ kaka, ama nɛ pɔ̃n sisɨn ãnɛ jo nɛu ɔ̃ nagbete Ɗalapa ã yɛ. <verse eid="ROM 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4" />Ɔ gbɔki aɗɔ abiini waanɛ, kopi gbɔki shopiya i vishonɛ ji ɗɔn a kɨ̃nkɨ̃n piti kpai. <verse eid="ROM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5" />A nyabamkɔ nagbete u waanɛm upɛ yɔpɔ gbete a kirisi ɗɔbiini, u dɔsitɛ u ɔ̃tɛ gbete piti kpai a gãsiyini naa u gboki bi gbete. <verse eid="ROM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6" />Kɛɗɔn u shovi shonɛ jo a vitɔ̃vɨng gbete Ɗalapa ãu bang ni a nyaba tɔ̃vɨn, u shovi shonɛ ayini, kɛ ɔ̃nɛ a nyaba shɔ Ɗalapa nyaruubii nwarinɛ u pɛli vishonɛ jo awuni nagbete u sisɨn ãnɛ ɔ̃ yɛ ni; <verse eid="ROM 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7" />kɛ ɔ̃nɛ Ɗalapa basinɛ, u basiutɔ, kɛ ɔ̃nɛ shɔ vimatinɛ, u mati shɔtɔ; <verse eid="ROM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8" />kɛ ɔ̃nɛ zɔ bi masinɛ u pɛlitɔ ji nankɔ. Kɛ ɔ̃nɛ shɔ vi ãnɛ u ã a sisɨn gbete; yupɛ̃ni i sã shɔ nakaziti; shɔ shɔraa ntaayi i pɛli vishonɛ jo a sisɨn puru.<verse eid="ROM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9" />Zɔ ɔrinɛ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ vitɔ̃vɨng pẽniba. Ɔ bɛ̃ɛ̃ rukɔ̃li a ɔ̃ vilanɛ yɛ tɔ, ɔ sã ɓɛjo nyaba tɔ̃vɨn pɛlinɛ. <verse eid="ROM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10" />Ɔ ɔri zɔtɔ a zɔ basinɛni waanɛ nagbete kirisa i pɛliyɛ. <verse eid="ROM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11" />Ɔ ɔ̃ shɔ vishonɛyi ɔkɔ ɔ̃nɛ pnzɛ̃, ɔ pɛli Ɗalapa vishonɛtɔ naa shɔgbete ãu surutɛ au biini piti kpai. <verse eid="ROM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12" />Ɔ sisɨn pɔ̃nɛu u ɔ̃ yɛti puru, ɔkɔ yɔriyunɛ awɔ yukɔnɛuni ɔ gaki Ɗalapa tɔ a lee-lee. <verse eid="ROM 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13" />Ɔ vasiɔɔ vinaatɔ a mɛzɔ kirisa gbeteyi ɓɛɛ ɓa yɛ ni, ɔ tɛɛ shɔzati i naatɔ awɔ wɛrɛni.<verse eid="ROM 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14" />Ɔ gaki Ɗalapa tɔ u tasi shɔgbete i bɛ̃ɛ̃ wɔ ruubii anɔni vɔ susari abiini- Nn ɔ gakiutɔ u tasiyi vɔ susãri abi ɓanɛ nɛu wiritɔ ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15" />Ɔ nta yɛti purutɔ a shɔgbete i nta yɛti puru yɛ ni wɔsɔ̃n ɔ sɨntɔ a shɔgbete i a ɗɔɔ sɨnnɛ yɛ ni. <verse eid="ROM 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16" />Ɔ ɔ̃ ɔ̃nɛ binyatɔ̃nɛ a zɔni, ɔkɛ ɔ̃nɛ shɔ yuu tunɛyi, ama ɔ shoji vigbete yɛ rawɔ yuu piti kpai yɛ. Ɔkɔ tasaɔ yuunɛ naa ɔpɛ shɔ sẽrẽẽyi.<verse eid="ROM 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17" />Naa shɔwɔ kɛ pɛlaɔ vikɔ̃linɛ nɛ, ɔkɔ kɔsi nɔnɛ. Ɔ nta pɛlinɛ jo vigbete kopiya tunɛ nɛ pɛ vitɔ̃vɨng yɛ. <verse eid="ROM 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18" />Ɔ pɛli jo vigbete ɔyɛ pɛliyɛ ɔ ɔ̃ ɔ̃nɛ binyatɔ̃nɛ a kopiya ni. <verse eid="ROM 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19" />Ɔkɔ kɔsinɔ vikɔ̃linɛ gbete mɛsayi pɛlɔɔ yɛ nɛ, ama ɔkɛ kɔsinɔ nɛ ɔ yaa Ɗalapa u kɔsɔɔ nɔɔrɛ, aru Ɗalapa nyaruubii shatɛttɔ nɛ, &lt;&lt;N yɛ kɔsiyi nɔɔtɔ Ɗalapa sharɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20" />Naa kɛ pɛli vimnɛ, nɔgbete Ɗalapa nyaruubii sharɛ nɛ: &lt;&lt; wɔ̃ɔ̃ kɛ sɨn mɛshɔnɔpɔ̃yi nɛ ɔ ãi vishaanɛtɔ i shaarɛ; I kɛ ntaa sutunɛ ɔ ãi miitɔ i boorɛ; Naa ɔkɛ pɛliyi vimnɛ nam i sisɨn yɛ tootɔ a yusẽẽni pẽniba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21" />Ɔkɔ ya rukɔ̃linɛ u rawɔ sisɨnrɛ, ama ɔ yiki rukɔ̃linɛ a vitɔ̃vɨng pɛlinɛ.<verse eid="ROM 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13" />
  <para style="s1">Yupɛ̃niyi Nya Gɨnnɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1" />Kopiya ɔ̃riutɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ u gɨn nya ãsinɛ tipitɔ aru iviya nya ãnɛ wɔɔ yɛ shi ɓa naa Ɗalapa ji pɔ̃naa ɓa dɔni bayɛ, ama nya ãsinɛ a shiyɛ pɛ Ɗalapa pɔ̃urɛ ɗɔuni. <verse eid="ROM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2" />Shɔgbete ji gɨn vigbete nyaãsinɛ a shayɛ ɓa, si bɛ̃ɛ̃ pɛ vigbete Ɗalapa ãsinya ɗɔn; Ama shɔgbete kɛ pɛlinɛ namni si n ti ruyeenɛtɛ au yuuni. <verse eid="ROM 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3" />Shɔ gbeteyi pɛli tɔ̃vɨn i nta Kpatiyi seti ɓa, see shɔgbete i pɛli rukɔ̃linɛ yɛ. Ɔ kasi nɛi ntaa seti kpatiyi ya? Ɔ ji kasi nam ɓa ɔ pɛli vigbete tɔ̃vɨn, nɔgbete i yɛ basɔɔ yɛ, <verse eid="ROM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4" />Aru i pɛ Ɗalapa jashonɛyi shoshi vitɔ̃vɨng jo ɔkɔyi. Ama ɔ kɛ pɛli vikɔ̃linɛ nɛ ɔ ntayi setittɔ, aru i kaka shɔ yusho gɔ̃nɛ pɛ nizɛ. I pɛ Ɗalapa jashnɛyi i n ti ruu Ɗalapa shɔ yusho gɔ̃nɛ a shɔgbeteyi pɛli ruukɔ̃linɛ yɛ yuu. <verse eid="ROM 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5" />Arumkɔ ɔ̃rɔɔtɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ ɔ gɨn nya ãsinɛmtɔ, ɓa nɛ aru Ɗalapa shɔ yusho gɔ̃nɛ ɓa, ama sɔ̃njo ayuu ruumkɔ.<verse eid="ROM 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6" />Sɔ̃njo ruumkɔ ɔ sho saabɛnɛ rɛ, aru nya ãsinɛmyi i shoshi Ɗalapa vishonɛ i yisi nya vishonɛ gbete shɔ pɔ̃yi nɛi pɛliyɛ. <verse eid="ROM 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7" />Ɔ shori kopiya vigbete i gɨnwɔ yɛtɔ; Ɔ basiyitɔ nagbete i banɛ sã yɛ wɔsɔ̃n ɔ shori saabɛnɛ awɔ yuu viiyi ni piti kpai.<verse eid="ROM 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔ Ɔri Zɔtɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8" />Ɔkɔ ya shɔwɔ ruukɔ̃linɛ nɛ awɔ yuu, ruugbete yɛ ɔ̃ awɔ yuu ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ ɔ ɔri zɔtɔ shɔgbete kɛ pɛli vim nɛ si gɨn nya ãsinɛmtɛ. <verse eid="ROM 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9" />Nya ãsinɛu shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Mɔkɔ roonɛ a suuni; Mɔkɔ ɓɔɔ-ɓɔɔnɛ; Mɔkɔ kagɨnnɛ shɔwɔ vinaa ni&gt;&gt; shom piti kpai a shɔ gãsi wɔyini i ɓasirɛ i ɔ̃kɛ nya ãsinɛ gbete shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔraa shɔnyakãsiri nagbete a ɔraa yuu yɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10" />Akɛ ɔraa ɔri shɔ gãsiyinɛ iyɛ pɛliyi vikɔ̃linɛ ɓa; Kɛɗɔn ji nankɔ akɛ pɛlinɛ nam si a gɨn nya ãsinɛtɛ piti kpai.<verse eid="ROM 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11" />Ɔ̃raatɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ ɔ pɛli vimrɛ, aru iviya ɔ zɛtɛttɔ ɗagbete ɔyɛ nisi a nɔroo yɛ pɛlitɛttɔ. Aru ɗagbete shɔyɛ rauyɛ atɛtɔ maani, dɔdɔrim ɓa naa ɗagbete u gaa sisɨn ãnɛ yɛ ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12" />Tete zɨnba pɛlitɛttɔ dii ma atɛ ɗɔn kanɛ, ya viɗɔɔ kɨnri pɛlinɛ kati, ɔ tuu vibaawaanɛ aru ɔ wabaa a ɗɔsẽsẽẽ. <verse eid="ROM 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13" />U kɔyuutɔ tɔ̃vɨn naa shɔgbete i ɔ̃ a ɗɔsẽsẽẽ yɛ, ɔkɔ pɛli viyumusinɛ kɔ̃linɛ nɛ naa shɔgbete i ɓoo saa i wiriyɛ ɓa, shɔ roonɛ a soro ko vɔshɔ ɓa ko nya yeelinɛ ko yukɔ̃nɛ n tinɛ ko shɔ yuuvɔ nyɔnɛ ko gɨnkaanɛ ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14" />Ama ɔ tu Yesɔ kirisi vibaawaanɛ, ɔ yawɔ nyaba ruuvini pɛlinɛ kati a yuu ãnɛ a vikɔ̃linɛ gbete i a kotipimini pɔ̃nɛ a sisɨn.<verse eid="ROM 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔkɔ yeeri zɔ ruunɛ yuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1" />Ɔ tɛɛ shɔgbete i sisɨn ãnɛ nakaziti, ama ɔkɔ masi nyanɛ ayini ayuu viwɔni. <verse eid="ROM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2" />Shɔwɔyi i sisɨn ãnɛ ãi naatɔ nɛi shaa ko iviyatɔ, ama shɔgbete sisɨn ãnɛ ɓa i shaa ɓɛjo gaapɛ kɔ sheeli. <verse eid="ROM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3" />Shɔgbete ai shaa koviya nɛ ukɔ zɛ shɔu au shaa ɓam nɛ pɛ shɔ kɔ̃linɛ, a shɔ au shaa ɓam ukɔ tu shɔ au shaavi nɛu pɛ shɔruvini au ɗekɨn ni, aru Ɗalapa tɛutɛttɔ nakaziti. <verse eid="ROM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4" />A ɓɛɛ piya a shanɛn yeeruu au shɔwɔ jawɛrɛ viya? Ɓɛɛ ji i shɔwɛrɛ kɔ sheeli ukɔ yɛ yeeruu nɛi yɛ ɗekɨntɔ ko nɛi yɛ ɓa. I yɛ- yɛ ɗekɨntɔ, aru Ɗalapa pɔ̃irɛ nɛi ɗekɨn rɛ.<verse eid="ROM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5" />Shɔwɔyi tuu mɛnɛ dii wɔyi tɛu u gãsiyitɔ a tɔ̃vɨn, a shɔwiyi tuu sɔ̃njo nɛ diiwiyi piti kpai nɛi zali. Kopiya u ɔ̃ jo ɔ̃nɛ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ au ɔ̃nɛ suruni. <verse eid="ROM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6" />Shɔgbete ai tu dii wɔ nɛ pɛ lee tɔ̃vɨn pɛli nankɔ aru u basi Ɗalapa nii; Shɔgbete ai shaa ko iviya i shaa jo aru i basi Ɗalapa nii, pɛli vim aru i dɔ̃ri Ɗalapa a yuu vishaanɛ ãi yɛ ni. Shɔgbete ai shaa ɓam i bɛ̃ɛ̃ shaanɛ jo aru i Ɗalapa basinɛ nii, ama i dɔ̃ri Ɗalapa tɔ. <verse eid="ROM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7" />U ji ɔ̃ ɓa suruni awɔ ruu yuu kɔ sheeli ɓa, a uji vɔɓa au ruu yuukɔ sheeli ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8" />U kɛ ɔ̃nɛ a suru, u ɔ̃ pɛ aru Uɓeyelapa, ama u kɛ vɔnɛ u vɔpɛ aru Uɓeyelapa. Kɛɗɔn ko u vɔrɛ ko u ji vɔɓa upɛ Uɓeyelapa ɓɛɛ. <verse eid="ROM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9" />Aru Uɓeyelapa vɔrɛ a yulapa a suru ni aru u ɔ̃ shɔgbete ai suruni a shɔgbete ai vɔtɛttɔ i Uɓeyelapa. <verse eid="ROM 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10" />Kɛɗɔn ɔ shɔ gbete awɔ shaa bɛjo gapa kɔ sheeli ɔ yeeri shɔwɔyi ruu kɛ nɛ ivi a yuuni viya? Koma ɔ shaa ko iviyatɔ, aru ivi ɔ ã shɔ sisɨn ãnɛmiyi ruu ayuu viya? U piti kpai uyɛ shi a Ɗalapa ɗekɨn u yeerɔɔ ruu ayuu. <verse eid="ROM 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11" />Aru Ɗalapa nyaruubii shanɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">&lt;&lt;Ɗalapa shanɛ n tɛɛ tɛ ang ɗɔɔ ɔ̃nɛni, kopi yugbot shopiya yɛ taa ang ɗekɨn u geen nyarɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">kopiya yɛ taa a yugboti ang ɗekɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">kopiya yɛ sha au nya nɛn pɛu Ɗalapa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12" />Kɛɗɔn kopiya au tete yɛ sha vigbete pɛliyɛ piti kpai a Ɗalapa ɗekɨn.<verse eid="ROM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔkɔ pɔ̃ shɔwɔyi nɛ kɔdɔɔrɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13" />Kɛɗɔn u ya zɔ̃ ruu yeerinɛ kati a yuuni. Ukɔ pɛli vigbete yɛ pɔ̃rɛ shɔwɔyi i nwesirɛ a ruuvini yɛ nɛ. <verse eid="ROM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14" />N zɛtɛttɔ ang ɔ̃nɛ awɔ Uɓeyelapa kirisi Yesɔ ni, vishaa wɔɔ pɔ̃ shɔu ɔ̃ vi sisɨn zaanɛ yɛ ɓa; ama akɛ ã sisɨn nɛ vishaa wɔyi i pɛ visisɨn zaanɛ, kɛɗɔn yɛ ɔ̃ kɛ visisɨn zaanɛ aa biini. <verse eid="ROM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15" />Akɛ pɛli shɔwɔyi vikɔ̃linɛ nɛ aru vigbete a shaa yɛ ni, kɛɗɔn si ji pɛli ɓa a yɛti zɔ̃ ɔrinɛ ɓa. Mokaa yanɛ nɛ a vishaa u ɔ̃rii shɔgbete Kirisi vɔ au yuu yɛ vikɔ̃linɛ ɓaǃ <verse eid="ROM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16" />Mokaa yanɛ nɛ vigbete a tu nɛ pɛ tɔ̃vɨn yɛ shɔ ã nii kɔ̃linɛ. <verse eid="ROM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17" />Aru kpati roonɛ Ɗa wɛrɛ ji shi ɓa aru viɓoonɛ a shaanɛ ko sheeli ɓa, ama aru vitɔ̃vɨng pɛlinɛ wɔsɔ̃n ɔ̃nɛ binyatɔ̃nɛ a sisɨn puru ntanɛ gbete Ɗa Suru ã yɛ. <verse eid="ROM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18" />Naa akɛ gɨn kirisi nɛ a nyaba nam, si a pɛli vitɔ̃vɨngtɛ Ɗa a shɔ gãsiyi ɗekɨn ni gbete yɛ pɔ̃ i ã yuu abi.<verse eid="ROM 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19" />Kɛɗɔn ɔ̃riutɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ u shi jo yuu vigbete ai n ti ɔ̃nɛ binyatɔ̃nɛ a vigbete naa au kɛ pɛlinɛ yɛ masi zɔ̃ biiyɛ. <verse eid="ROM 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20" />Ukɔ pɛli vigbete aru vishaa au lesi vigbete a Ɗalapa pɛliyɛ nɛ. Vishaa piti kpai shɔyɛ shaatɔ, aru ɓa tɔ̃vɨn ɓa u shaa vigbete ai pɔ̃ shɔwɔrɛ u nwesirɛ a yɛti ruuvini yɛ ni ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21" />Kɔritɔ shɔkɔ shaa yɔpɔnɛ saa ɓoonɛ ko viwu pɛlinɛ gbete yɛ pɔ̃ shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ i nwesirɛ yɛ ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22" />Shi jo yuu vgbete a ã sisɨn au yuu yɛ nankɔ, kɛɗɔn atette mokɔ a Ɗalapani. Binyatɔ̃nɛ yɛ ɔ̃tɔ a shɔgbete i ã sisɨntɛ nɛi pɛli ruuvinitɛ ayuu ruugbete Ɗalapa yeeri ruu au yuu yɛ ni. <verse eid="ROM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23" />Ama shɔgbete ji ã sisɨn ɓa ayuu vigbete shaa yɛ ni ɓa, Ɗalapa yɛ lesitɔ ɗagbete i shaa yɛ ni, aru i shinɛu ji shi ɓa a nyaba sisɨn ãnɛ ɓa, aru vigbete a shi ɓa nyaba sisɨn ãnɛ ɓa pɛ ruuvini.<verse eid="ROM 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15" />
  <para style="s1">Pɔ̃ Mɛzɔ̃yi i Nta a tɔ̃vɨntɔ Ɓa a Yuu Ɓa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1" />U shɔgbete ai sisɨn ãnɛ lakitɔ miyi, kɔritɔ u pɔ̃si shɔgbete ai sisɨn ãnɛ laki ɓam i naatɔ, ukɔ ɔrinɛ ɔ yuukɔ sheeli. <verse eid="ROM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2" />Aru nankɔ u pɛli shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ gãsiyi jo vitɔ̃vɨng, nɔgbete i yɛ ɓaa ai sisɨn ãnɛ yɛ. <verse eid="ROM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3" />Aru kirisi ji tasi ɔrinɛ ɓau yuukɔ sheeli ɓa, a nyabankɔ, Ɗa nyaruubii shanɛ, &lt;&lt;dãnɛ gbete shɔ dã wɔ sɔtɛ ang yuu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4" />Vigbete shɔ bee a Ɗanyaruubii shanɛ, shɔ beerɛ nɛ shɔ matɔɔ vi, nɔgbete ɔ̃ yɛ a sisɨn pɔ̃nɛ a nyaba ɔ̃nɛ sisɨn zaza wɔɔ sɔ̃n a bi manɛ nɔgbete Ɗanyaruubii ãwɔ yɛ. <verse eid="ROM 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5" />Ɗalapa gbete ã shɔ sisɨn zaza a bi manɛni u ãwɔ ɔ̃nɛ binyatɔ̃nɛ a bilakinɛ a zɔni nagbete ɔkɛ gɨn kirisi Yesɔ vipɛlinɛ nɛ yɛ. <verse eid="ROM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6" />Aru ɔ bassi Uɓeyelapa Ɗalapa Yesɔ kirisi a sisɨn gbete, ɔ nya u ɔ̃ jo gbete awɔ nyaba gɨnnɛni.<verse eid="ROM 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɗanyaruubii a Shɔgbete i ɓa Yahudawayi Atete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7" />Ɔ tɛɛ zɔ nakaziti nɔgbete Kirisi tɛɛ nakaziti yɛ, aru Uɓeyelapa Ɗalapa nii bassinɛ. <verse eid="ROM 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8" />Aru n gelɔɔtɛ Kirisi vishonɛ si aru shɔ Yahudawayi yuu, u tasi rutɔ̃vɨng a Ɗalapa yuu gbete si Ɗalapa matɛ a mɛwuruyini yɛ u ɔ̃ nizɛ, <verse eid="ROM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9" />aru shɔgbete i ɓa yahudawayi i basi Ɗalapa tɔ au ruu raa ntanɛ. Nagbete Ɗanyaruubii shanɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">&lt;&lt;Arumkɔ n yɛn bassaatɔ a shɔgbete i ɓa yahudawayi tetteni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:9">n yɛn tɔ̃soo so Ɗalapa nii basinɛtɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10" />Sɔ̃n Ɗanyaruubii shanɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:10">&lt;&lt;Ɔ nta binyatɔ̃nɛtɔ shɔgbete ɔ ɓa yahudawayi ɓayi a Ɗalapa shɔ gɨnnɛ miyi ni!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11" />Sɔ̃n totti Ɗanyaruubii shanɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:11">&lt;&lt;ɔ bassi Ɗalapa tɔ nii shɔgbete ɔ ɓa Yahudawa ɓa kpai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:11">ɔ bassiutɔ shɔzɛyi piti kpai!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12" />toti janyagadi shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Yessi ɓɛwuruyi iyɛ shɛtɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">ukɔ yɛ arɛ u ɔ̃ shɔgbete i ɓa Yahudawa ɓayi kpati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">iyɛ pɔ̃yi sisɨn jo au bikɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13" />Ɗalapa gbete au ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ nyaba sisɨn pɔ̃nɛ pɛlinɛ, u pɔ̃rɛ ɔ ɔ̃ a sisɨn puru wɔsɔ̃n a binyatɔ̃nɛ nɔgbete ɔ ã sisɨn a Ɗa bi ɔ yɛ ɗekɨn a ɓaanɛni a Ɗa suru kaka naa pɔ̃sinɛ.<verse eid="ROM 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Vishonɛ Gbete Ɗalapa ã Bulus yɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14" />Masayiː N ang yuu nta vitɔ̃vɨng tɛttɔ awɔ yuuni nɛ, ɔ kpai ɔ pɛ shɔ tɔ̃vɨnyi awɔ vipɛlinɛni, ɔ vizɛnɛ aɗɔn wannɛ aru ɔ yɛtɛ nɔgbete ɔ yɛ mati zɔ vi yɛ. <verse eid="ROM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15" />Ama a ɓuzɨn sẽkoo gbete n beerɔɔ mi ayuu vigbete n nwanya a kakani au yuu, n kasirɛ ɔ mabiitɔ wannɛ aru sisɨn kpaanɛ ayuu vitɔ̃vɨng gbete Ɗalapa ãng yɛni <verse eid="ROM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16" />au pɔ̃rɛ nɛn n ɔ̃ Yesɔ kirisi jawɛrɛ n pɛli shɔgbete ɓa yahudawa ɓayi vishonɛ, n pɛli vishonɛ naa yupɛ̃ni nyawanɛ n aɗɔgbete n nwari shɔ Ɗalapa nyaruubii yɛ, nɔgbete Ɗalapa yɛ tɛɛ shɔgbete i ɓa yahudawa ɓayi i viyuu ãnɛ gbete wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ a Da suru kabii yɛ. <verse eid="ROM 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17" />Nagbete u a kirisi Yesɔni gbete, kɛɗɔn n yɛn ɓasitɔ aɗagbete nkɛ shoshi Ɗalapa vishonɛ yɛ. <verse eid="ROM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18" />N yɛn nta yɛti purutɔ n nwanya ayuu vigbete kirisi pɛlin ang kabii nɔgbete n teesi shɔgbete i ɓa yahudawa ɓayi ɗekɨn i gɨn Ɗalapa nya ãsinɛ, Ɗalapa pɛli vishonɛ au nyanwanɛ wɔsɔ̃n a vigbete pɛliyɛ. <verse eid="ROM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19" />A kaka gbete shovishonɛ vibiizaanɛ a vitasinɛ wɔsɔ̃n a Ɗa suru kaka, gbete pɔ̃siu naa aɗɔ rakinɛ yunɛ Urushalima yɛnɛ tipi Ilirikun aɗɔgbete nwari shɔ kirisi nyaruubii waanɛ kopi ɗɔpiya. <verse eid="ROM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20" />Vigbete n kasi n pɛli a lee-lee yɛ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ n nwari shɔ kirisi nyaruubii aɗɔgbete shɔ ji nta ɓa shãa yɛ ɓa, nɔgbete n yɛn pɔ̃naa ɓa vigbete shɔwɔ gaa yɛ ni ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21" />Nagbete Ɗanyaruubii shanɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">&lt;&lt;shɔgbete shɔ ji geliyi ruuwɔ ɓa au yuuni ɓa i yɛ zɛ kati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:21">a shɔgbete i ji nta ɓa i yɛ zɛ dɔɔ ruu kati.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bulus Maa au Sisɨn Nɛn yɛ Zati a Rooma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22" />Kɛɗɔn vinkɔ pɔ̃rɛ wannɛ n ji kpaa yɛnɛ ɔ ɗɔbbii ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23" />Ama dɔdɔtrim n yisi nya vishonɛ pɛlinɛtɛ a tipimni si n gaatɛ saa waanɛ n awɔ ɗɔbiirɛ n zɛwɔrɛ, <verse eid="ROM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24" />n kasirɛ n zɛwɔtɔ dɔdɔtrim ang nyaba yɛnɛ tipi Asbaniya, n yɛn ntaa tɔ̃vɨntɔ naa ɔ kɛ dɔ̃n naa yɛnɛ ɗɔutɔ, akɨnti gbete n nta yɛti puru zati nɔnɛtɔ awɔ ɗɔbiini, aɗagbete n ɔ̃ a ɔkɔni dɔɔ ziti yɛ. <verse eid="ROM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25" />Dɔdɔrim n yɛkɛ Urushalima n nwari Ɗalapa shɔ gɨneyi ruutɔ̃vɨng aɗɔwakɔ. <verse eid="ROM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26" />Aru shɔ Ɗalapa gɨnnɛ gbete i a tipi Makidoniya a tipi Akaya i ntaa binyatɔ̃nɛtɔ a vigbete i ã shɔranɛ gɨnnɛyi ai a tipi Urushalima yɛtɔ. <verse eid="ROM 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27" />I nta binyatɔ̃nɛtɔ a vigbete i pɛliyɛni, aru viwu ɔ̃tɛ naa vi kɔnɛ ai yuu, nagbete shɔ gɨnnɛ Yahudawa i ɓasiyutɛ ayini aru sẽrẽe gbete Ɗa ãi yɛni, ɔ̃ritɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ i pɔ̃si shɔgbete i ɓa Yahudawa ɓa naa sɔ̃njo. <verse eid="ROM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28" />Naa n kɛ yisi nya vishonɛm nɛ, n yɛn sɔri saa gbete n kpaari yɛrɛ piti kpai, n yɛn yairɛ n zakɛ tipi Asbaniya n zɛwɔrɛ ang nyaba zati yɛnɛ. <verse eid="ROM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29" />N zɛtɛ naa nkɛ awɔ ɗɔbiinɛ, n yɛn a a tete kirisi vɔɔ susãri tasinɛ bi waanɛ.<verse eid="ROM 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30" />Ama n gaki ɔtɔ masayi a Uɓeyelapa kirisi Yesɔ nii a ɔrinɛ gbete Ɗa suru ãwɔyɛ, ɔ pɔ̃sin naa jo ɔ gakinɛ Ɗa ang yuu. <verse eid="ROM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31" />Ɔ gaki Ɗatɔ n ranaa a shɔgbete iji ã sisɨn ɓa a tipi Yahudiya a nɔgbete n vishonɛ aru Ɗanyaruubii nwanɛ shɔ Ɗa gɨnnɛyi a Urushalima i tɛɛtɔ nakaziti. <verse eid="ROM 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32" />N yɛn awɔ ɗɔbiitɔ a sisɨn puru naa Ɗa kɛ kasinɛ yɛ, n ntaa yɛti puru a binyatɔ̃nɛ a ɔkɔni aɗagbete nkɛ nɔzati sɔ̃n nɛ awɔ ɗɔbiiyɛni. <verse eid="ROM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33" />Ɗalapa gbete au ɔ̃rɛ nyaba binyatɔ̃nɛ u ɔ̃ a ɔkɔni kpai. Nankɔ.<verse eid="ROM 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16" />
  <para style="s1">Bulus Gee bɛsayi nya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1" />N kasirɛ n gelɔɔ viwɔ a u ɓɛnaa Fibi yuu, shɔu shɔshi Ɗalapa vi a wɛrɛ Ɗa Sinkiriya. <verse eid="ROM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2" />Ɔ tɛu au Uɓeyelapa nii, naa shɔ Ɗalapa i pɛliyɛ, ɔ pɔ̃siu naa a vigbete kasi awɔ ɗɔbiiyɛ; upɛ shɔ wesa tɔ̃vɨn a shɔzɛ waanɛyi bi a nkɔni.<verse eid="ROM 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3" />N shoshi pirisila nya geenɛtɛ a Akila ni, n shɔgbete u shoshi Kirisi Yesɔ vishonɛ a yiniyɛ; <verse eid="ROM 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4" />i ãi yuutɛ ang bi. Shɔgbete i ã yuutɛ nɛi vɔ ang yuu. N dɔ̃ritɛ piti kpai, ɓa nkɔ sheeli ɓa, ama shɔgbete i ɓa Yahudawayi shɔ Ɗa wɛrɛ gɨnyi gbete i ã yuu nɛi vɔ ang yɛ. <verse eid="ROM 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5" />N kasirɛ ɔ geerin wɔsɔ̃n shɔ wɛrɛ Ɗa gbete i toli nya ai wɛrɛyi yɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:5">N kasirɛ ɔ geerin ang masa ɔrinɛ Ifanitusi nya, shɔu si ukɔ ɗekɨn a tipi Asiya ai ã sisɨn a Kirisi biiyɛ. <verse eid="ROM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6" />Nya geenɛ yɛnɛ a Mariyamu bi, shɔgbete au shovi waanɛ awɔ yuu. <verse eid="ROM 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7" />N kasirɛ ɔ geerin wɔsɔ̃n yɛnɛ a Andarakus a Juniya, masa Yahuwa gbete u si ayini a jahmyɛ; shɔ zɛi nii tɛttɔ waanɛ a tete Yesɔ jashonɛyini, ai rii kirisa ang ɗekɨn n rii sɔ̃n kɛkn.<verse eid="ROM 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8" />N kasirɛ geerin Ampiliyatu nya, n shɔ masa gbete u ɓasi yuu ayini au ɓeyelapa nii. <verse eid="ROM 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9" />N kasirɛ ɔ geerin wɔsɔ̃n Uribanu nya, n shɔ vishonɛ gbete au pɛli Kirisi vishonɛ a wuniyɛ, a yɛnɛ Sitakis, n masa ɔrinɛ. ɗɔbii. <verse eid="ROM 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10" />N kasirɛ ɔ geerin Apilɛs nya, shɔgbete au ã yuu tɛttɔ a Kirisi biini a shɔ pɔ̃siu naa tɛttɔ. Nya genɛ yɛnɛ shɔgbete shɔ yeeyi a Aritobulu i yeenɛ. <verse eid="ROM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11" />N kasirɛ ɔ geerin Herodiya bi, masa Yahudawayi, wɔɔ sɔ̃n Kirisa a Nakisu yi yeenɛ.<verse eid="ROM 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12" />N kasirɛ ɔ geerin Tirafena a Tirifosa nya, shɔu shoshi Uɓeyelapa viyɛ, a n masa ɔrinɛ Perisi, shɔgbete au shɔshi Uɓeyelapa vitɛ waanɛ. <verse eid="ROM 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13" />N kasirɛ ɔ geerin Rufusi nya, a ɓini ni shɔgbete au shoshi Uɓeyelapa vi shɔ zɛu nii tɛttɔ waanɛ, gbete au tun naa ɓɛjaa. <verse eid="ROM 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14" />N kasirɛ ɔ geerin Asinkiritu a Filgon nya, a Hemas a Patirobasi a Herimasi a shɔ Kirisa gãsiyi gbete i a wuniyɛ. <verse eid="ROM 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15" />N kasirɛ geerin Filologu a Juliya, wɔsɔ̃n Nireyu a ɓɛnani, yɛnɛ Olimpasi a shɔ Ɗa gɨnnɛ gbete i a wuniyɛni kpai. <verse eid="ROM 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16" />Ɔ gee zɔ nyatɔ a zɔ nakɔ̃tinɛ abi. Shɔ wɛrɛ Ɗa Kirisiyi i gee ɔ nyatɛ piti kpai.<verse eid="ROM 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nya kɔsinɛ Dangdang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17" />N gaki ɔtɔ masayi: Ɔ kɔyuutɔ a shɔgbeteyi kasɔɔ yuu vɔsinɛ a sisɨn lɛsinɛ a nyaba gbete ɔ tɛɛ vi matinɛyɛ. Ɔkɔ ɓasi yuunɛ a yini! <verse eid="ROM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18" />Aru shɔgbete i pɛli iri vim i ɓa shɔgbete i shɔshi Kirisi Uɓeyelapa viyɛ ɓa, ama see i yɛti kɔ sheeli. Ai nyanwanɛ gbete shɔ̃shɔ̃mi i ɗakijo shɔgbete i weshɔ ai nyayɛ. <verse eid="ROM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19" />Ko-piya i nta wɔɔ ruubii tɛttɔ aru yuu ãnɛ gbete ɔ ã a Ɗanyaruubiini, jo ruumkɔ n nta binyatɔ̃nɛtɔ a ɔkɔni. N kasirɛ ɔ ɔ̃ shɔ kpẽtɔ aru vigbete tɔ̃vɨnyɛ, ama ɔ ɔ̃ shɔ tɔ̃vɨn ayuu vigbete ɓa tɔ̃vɨn ɓayɛ ni. <verse eid="ROM 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20" />Ɗalapa gbete au kɔ ɔ̃rɛ u nyaba binyatɔ̃nɛ, ɓa dɔkɔkɔ ɓa yɛ pɔ̃rɛ ɔ nali japẽpẽ au tɛɛli doo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:20">Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ u vitɔ̃vɨng pɛlinɛ u ɔ̃ a ɔkɔni.Nankɔ.<verse eid="ROM 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21" />Timoti, n masa vishonɛ pɛlinɛ gee wɔ nyatɛ; a Lusiyani a Jason wɔsɔ̃n Susibata u shɔ yuu ɓasinɛ Yahudawayi gee wɔ nyatɛ piti kpai. <verse eid="ROM 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22" />Nkɔ Tartiyu, shɔgbete au beerɔɔ sẽkom, gee wɔ nyatɛ.<verse eid="ROM 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23" />Gayu n shɔ nɔɔsinɛ, au wɛrɛkɔ shɔ Kirisayi kpaa zɔrɛ, gee wɔ nyatɛ; Irasitusi, shɔ saa sãnɛ koomou, a u ɓɛzɔ̃ Kartusiyi i gee wɔ nyatɛ. <verse eid="ROM 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24" />Mɛnɛ Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi vitɔ̃vɨng pɛlinɛ u ɔ̃ a ɔkɔni piti kpai. Nankɔ.<verse eid="ROM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɗa Gakinɛ Bɛlinɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25" />U ã Ɗalapa bɛlinɛtɔ! Ukɔ yɛ sɨnrɛ a shi dɔkaziti aa sisɨn ãnɛni, nagbete ruutɔ̃vɨng shayɛnɛ nkɔng nwari shɔ nya aru Yesɔ Kirisi a nɔgbete shɔ shɛshi ruutɔ̃vɨng a shɔ ɓusi si tẽẽ tẽẽyɛ atette saa gbete i tɛ yɛ. <verse eid="ROM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26" />Dɔdɔrim, a shɔ shɛshi ruu nizɛutɛ a ɓili deredere a kaa Ɗalapa janyagadi i vi beenɛ; a nya ãsinɛ gbete Ɗalapa a vi tɛu kaka ɓa yɛ tasi shɔ ladurumiyi ruutɔ̃vɨngtɛ piti kpai, aru shɔgbeteyi kɛ ã sisɨn nɛ i gɨntɔ piti kpai.<verse eid="ROM 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27" />U ã jo Ɗalapa kɔ sheeli bassinɛ, u yɔbm ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔ kpẽnɛ piti kpai, bɛlinɛ kaa ɓɛjaa Yesɔ Kirisi bi dɔdɔtrim yɛnɛ ɗekɨn dangdang! Nankɔ.<verse eid="ROM 16:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16" />
</usx>